<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">- Ekajuk New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">Rom</para>
  <para style="toc1">Rom</para>
  <para style="toc2">Rom</para>
  <para style="mt2">NWER NYI POL NYONO TV</para>
  <para style="mt2">ANEB ERO BA LI GO</para>
  <para style="mt1">ROM</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1" />Me Pol, me wo kpꞌnyono nwer nyia, me ji li nlokeltum no Jisos Kraist, ji Esowo lung-m no re me n jol ntiingetib, fere yehk-m re me n tiingi nnoobo etib bi Esowo,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 9:15</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2" />bi Esowo nyame no mahne mahne sehng go anyo nya abanyehnamahr ba nyono no kak go mbarebara nwer Esowo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 16:26</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3" />Nnoobo etib bio li bada Mmon ewe. Ana nne, bo jel-e kak go etꞌtohngo ji Devid.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 1:1</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4" />Go eyaame ji Etingi Etohko ji li eje eje, á jolo Mmon no Esowo, Jisos Kraist Ntul ewahre. Esowo tibi jia go ege egburu nsahm, eji á nyahm-e go elkv,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 13:33</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5" />ye ji ma wahnge Esowo ma-r ka nnoobo, fere ka-r eltum ni nnoobo etib atiingi, eji e lꞌwahnge egom ane bandiki go nnahb anyehng anyehng nyi li go njini taame, fere jo wuk Esowo tib esi mbing nyi Jisos. <verse eid="ROM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6" />Wahn tob wob go ellong nio, wahn ji Jisos Kraist ma-n lung. <verse eid="ROM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7" />N kpꞌnyono tv wahn ane kpee, ba kpo kor Esowo, wahn ji li go Rom. Á ma-n lung re wahn jol ane babe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 1:7">Nong, Esowo Nso ejahre, a Ntul a Jisos Kraist ka-n nnoobo, a elkoono.<verse eid="ROM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Pol jo gare ana á bahke jeke go Rom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8" />N kpꞌgboko mbang kak Esowo ebame saam sehng goji Jisos Kraist tib wahn ane kpee. Tibre njini kpee ebwuk bade ana ḿ ma taame tv Esowo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Tes 1:8</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9" />Esowo bi n kpo lok-e a eltim eltim ename kpee, eji n kpꞌtiingi nnoobo etib bi Mmon ewe, ye wo kp-m yiimi ntianse re n kpo gahm-n gahm go egame ero ngare anyehng anyehng. <verse eid="ROM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10" />Ero ebame bi n kpo kak, n kpo gboongo Esowo ngare anyehng anyehng re, lꞌfere kor-e, á lim mbang anv, me m ba nyehn-n.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 19:21</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11" />Tibre kp-m sahb kꞌkor re me n nyehn-n, eji n lꞌkak-n ebo bio bi etohko, ń fere tahne.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 28:30-31</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12" />Jia lohngo re, e bahke jo kak atemtem eltim. Ekakesehk ejahne bahk-m eltim kak, ekakesehk ejame tob kak-n eltim.<verse eid="ROM 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13" />Abonanee, n kpꞌsebe re wahn kahn re, nkpel tvv n jo toobo re me m ba go egahne, eji n lꞌba, ba bong akab nti nyamongo go egahne, jang jang ana m bongo goji ane bako ba tob li ane baka baka. Ejum ji kpan-m re me n kꞌba go egahne tete sik anv. <verse eid="ROM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14" />Tibre n kpi aneb Grik mbong, a aneb ekulugbe, a akahnkahn ane, a ane ba kil kahne ejumjum.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 15:27; 1 Kor 9:16</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15" />Owo wahnge n kpꞌnoko re me n tob ba go Rom, ba tiing-n nnoobo etib fvfo.<verse eid="ROM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16" />N nehme be ndon go eltiingi nnoobo etib bi Kraist.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 9:26</char></note> Tibre kpi nsahm nyi Esowo nyi kpo tahre nne awohng awohng no lꞌtaame, gbo mbang tahre Jus, kehm tob tahre Grik. <verse eid="ROM 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17" />Tibre nnoobo etib bi kpo lennge ana nne bahke ma li eno go esamahr bi Esowo. Li ka nne no kpꞌtaame, fere soro asi ano. Ana nwer Esowo bungu no re, “Etingi nne bahke bele elkpin tib go ege eltaame.”<verse eid="ROM 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Esowo ma yake ane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18" />Tibre Esowo eblennge ana erakatahng eje bahke lohngo go ege ejahbetul ba gbo tub abi ane, fere gbo tub ane kpee ba kil-e elkake. Go bo abꞌbi wo, bo kpo kpan etingitingi jia.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 13:8</char></note><verse eid="ROM 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19" />Ji ane bahke ma kahn bade Esowo eblennge bo, tibre Esowo bi ma tib bo. <verse eid="ROM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20" />Bomo wuku wuku eji Esowo limi njini, ane ebnyehn nsahm enye nyi li go njinanjini, fere nyehn sange sange ana á lohko li Esowo go nsol nyi á limi no, jol eji nne lꞌkꞌma nyehn Esowo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 2:14-15; Hib 11:3</char></note> Owo wahnge bo lꞌkꞌma laange kunu ejum ajehng ajehng.<verse eid="ROM 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21" />Tibre bo kꞌkahn Esowo, jol bo we kaam ekpunu ji kehn bo jol-e kake. Jol saam bo we kakem. Ntir nyi bo kpꞌtiri anv, bo kpꞌfere tir mbol mbol. Ntim ebo li ekpakekpake, ebfere gbo ejannge.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ef 4:18</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22" />Eji bo kpꞌrodo elbo bum ana akahnkahn, bobfere jol agboolo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 1:20</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23" />Bobfere yaange ellub ni Esowo bi lꞌkꞌtiki kpo, fere ko asowo nya li go elfoongo nne no bahke kpoko, a ni nruk, a ni enyam, a ni enyo, fere kpꞌkake. <verse eid="ROM 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24" />Owo Esowo ma yake bo re bo jo lim nsol nyi ki li saang, nyi kpo kor bo go ellimi, fere jo ko agubjing ebo, jo lim nsol ndon atemtem.<verse eid="ROM 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25" />Tibre bobyaange etingitingi ji Esowo, fere ko efahnge, kpꞌkake nsol nyi Esowo limi no, fere jo loko nsol nyio, kehn nyi bo jol kake Esowo bi limi lim nsol nyio, bi fuumu re ane jo tehk-e go njinanjini. Emen.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ell 9:20</char></note><verse eid="ROM 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26" />Esi jio ji wahnge Esowo ma yake bo re bo jo lim nsol ndon nyi kpo kor bo go ellimi. Anebkal ebyaange eljini ni bo, fere kpꞌnoongo atemtem.<verse eid="ROM 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27" />Ano wo fvfo aneblum ma tob yake eljini ni bo jo lim a anebkal, fere kpꞌsahb jo mꞌmelle bo go bo a ntim re bo jo noongo atemtem. Aneblum kpꞌlimi nsol ndon atemtem, owo wahnge bo kpꞌnyehne etingitingi erem bi fuumu a bo go bo agubjing tib go bo abꞌbi.<verse eid="ROM 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28" />Bo joom seb re Esowo fili ntir atahng ebo. Owo wahnge á kehm yake bo re, abi ntir jo fili ntim ebo, eji bo lꞌfere jo lim ji ki fuumu re bo lim.<verse eid="ROM 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29" />Elkohn abꞌbi anyehng anyehng ebrur bo go bo a ntim, ana abi nsol alimi, amahr abaare, ebi ntir, ala ateele, ane awulu, etul arake, enehm, eblum alimi, a areyi alimi. <verse eid="ROM 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30" />Bo kpo kiimi afahnge lake ane. Esowo kpo sab bo. Bo kpo lim agadagv, fere jo lim agabbe, fere jo wor anyo. Bo kpo fum abꞌbi. Bo kpehme kak bab, a bab nnyehn. <verse eid="ROM 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31" />Bo li agboolo. Ekakesehk bo kpimm. Elkoro bo kpimm. Ndon bo kpimm.<verse eid="ROM 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32" />Jol eji bo kpꞌkahne ntahm nyi Esowo nyi bungu re, ane ba lꞌlim elkohn nsol ana nyia fuumu re bo kpo, bo kpo kpe soro na asi, jo lim nsol nyia, fere jo taame re, ane bako tob jo lim ano.<verse eid="ROM 1:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2" />
  <para style="s">Elam ji Esowo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1" />Fvfo, a lꞌjo lam nne noko, a nehm ma laange kunu ejum ajehng ajehng, afi a jolo elkohn nne awo. Tibre eji a kpꞌlame nne noko, a kpi elna ebi ka. Tibre wo jꞌnehm o ji kpꞌlame, a kpo tob lim nsol nyꞌnehm.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 7:2; Jon 8:7</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2" />E kpꞌkahne re, Esowo kpꞌlimi go nseenge, eji á kpꞌlame ane ba kpo lim nsol ana nyia.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ell 21:8</char></note><verse eid="ROM 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3" />Mbi, anv, a kpꞌtiri renan? A lꞌlam ane bako ba kpo lim elkohn nsol ana nyio, eji wofono antahng kpꞌtob lim ano, anv a bahke ma be for go elam ji Esowoa? <verse eid="ROM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4" />Afi a kpo rod afang nya nnoobo nyi Esowo, a elkpooro ene, a elkpuumu ene, jo lim mbene? Anv, a nehme kahn re, nnoobo nyi Esowo kpo tib nne mbang nyi egbokondona?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 8:11</char></note><verse eid="ROM 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5" />A kpi etahnsi ji a kil gboko ndon. Eji a kpꞌlimi ano, a kpꞌkuuru na erem bum elna sik efung erakatahng ji Esowo bahke tibi re á kpo lam etingitingi elam.<verse eid="ROM 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6" />Tibre Esowo bahke tuuru nne awohng awohng jang jang ana á limi no.<verse eid="ROM 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7" />Ane bandiki ba kpi ekakesehk go nnoobo alimi, fere jo seb ellub ni Esowo, a ekpunu, a elkpin ni ki kpi esꞌkohlo, bo ba Esowo bahke tuuru bo, ka elkpin ni li go njinanjini. <verse eid="ROM 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8" />Ane bandiki, agubjing ebo nya kpo ga kor bo, bo fere jo ten etingitingi, fere jo toono ebi mbang, bo ba Esowo bahke tuuru bo, ka egburu erakatahng eje.<verse eid="ROM 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9" />Nne awohng awohng no lꞌlim abꞌbi, á bahke nyehne erem, fere jol ndon ndon. Jus ji bahke gboko mbang, Grik toono.<verse eid="ROM 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10" />Wo, nne no lꞌlim ji kpꞌnobo, Esowo bahk-e kake ellub, a ekpunu, go elkoono. Jus ji bahke gboko mbang, Grik toono.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 13:46</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11" />Tibre Esowo kpehme rang nnene.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 10:34-35</char></note><verse eid="ROM 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12" />Ane ba limi abiafem, ba ki kahn atahm nya Moses, bo bahke tane, jol eji bo ki wꞌwoomo go elwo ni atahm.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Pit 2:6</char></note> Ane ba limi abiafem, ba kpꞌkahne atahm, atahm nyao nya bahke bo lam.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hib 2:2</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13" />Tibre ane ba kpꞌwuku atahm sang bahke lehke eno go esamahr Esowo. Ane ba kpꞌbumu atahm, bo ba bahke lehke eno.<verse eid="ROM 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14" />Ane baka baka ba ki nyi atahm, bo lꞌfere lim ji atahm bungu no, ana bo tiri no go bo a ntim, li ana bo kpi atahm go bo a ntim, jol eji bo kil kahne atahm nya Moses. <verse eid="ROM 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15" />Bo kpo tib go bo elkpin re, ji atahm bungu no, Esowo nyꞌnyon go bo a ntim.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 1:19</char></note> Ntir atahng ebo kpo tob yiimi ntianse re, jio lohko li go etingitingi. Tibre nkpel nyindiki ntir atahng ebo kpo ka bo ebi, nkpel nyindiki yiimi bo njahm. <verse eid="ROM 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16" />Ano wo bahke jolo go efung bi Esowo bahke lame nsol nyi wob ane go atahng sehng goji Jisos Kraist.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 4:5; Mak 4:22</char></note> Ejum jia ji n kpo kono eltiingi go egama nnoobo etib.<verse eid="ROM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jus, a atahm ebo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17" />A kpo lung elna re, wo nne a Jus. A kpehme bum atahm, wobtahm tonngo na tonngo go atahm,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 7:19; 9:28</char></note> fere kpꞌgeere kak Esowo. <verse eid="ROM 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18" />A kpꞌkahne mbang nyi Esowo. A kpꞌmale elyehke ji kpꞌnobo, tibre bo ma-a tib atahm. <verse eid="ROM 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19" />Woblohko kahn go etingitingi re, a bahke ma jo tib awakamahr mbang, fere kahn re, a li ana ellennge ka ane ba jehk go ejannge, <verse eid="ROM 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20" />a ntubelle no agboolo ane, a ntꞌtibi no abonse, eji a ma kahn atahm nya nsol kpee, a etingitingi wob no, nyi li ka nne re á kahn. <verse eid="ROM 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21" />Eji a kpo tib ane bako, jen ji wahnge a kil tob tib elna? A kpo bung alum Esowo re, “Ka jo v ejv!” Jen ji wahnge wofono antahng kpꞌvohko ejv!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 23:3</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22" />A kpo bung re, “Ka jo lim erehbe!” Jen ji wahnge wofono antahng kpꞌlimi erehbe?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jems 4:4</char></note> Eblom kpo sahb sab-a sab. Jen ji wahnge a kpo v ji li ka Esowo!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 21:13; 22:21</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23" />A kpo geere kak atahm. Jen ji wahnge a kpo daange Esowo eji a kpo soodo atahm enye? <verse eid="ROM 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24" />Ana nwer Esowo bungu no re, “Wahn Jus, wahn ba wahnge, ane baka baka kpo bung ebi bada mbing nyi Esowo.”<verse eid="ROM 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25" />A lꞌjo bum atahm, nrur nyi a ma yehke bahke nobo a na. A lꞌfere soodo atahm, nrur nyi a yehke no li ana a kala yehke nrur.<verse eid="ROM 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26" />Anv, nne no kala yehke nrur lꞌjo bum atahm, Esowo we nehm ko ana nne no ma yehke nrura?<verse eid="ROM 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27" />Ane baka baka ba kala yehke nrur, ba kpꞌbumu atahm, bo bahk-a ebi ka, wo ji ma yehke nrur, fere soodo atahm Esowo nya bo nyono no, nya a kpi no.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 11:32</char></note><verse eid="ROM 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28" />Nne no li nne a Jus go ngubjing wo wo, ye etingitingi nne a Jus sang. Nrur nyi bo kpo yehke go ngubjing, etingitingi nrur ayehke sang.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 8:39</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29" />Etingitingi nne a Jus li nne no li nne a Jus go ege atahng. Etingitingi nrur ayehke li nrur nyi nne yehke go ege eltim.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gal 5:6; Kol 2:11</char></note> Li ejum etohko, ji ngubjing sang. Elkohn nne noo, Esowo bi bahk-e tehke, ane sang.<verse eid="ROM 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1" />Anv, ejum ajehng ajehng jia, ji Jus kpi no sehnge ane baka bakaa? Nsehng anyi li go nrur ayehke? <verse eid="ROM 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2" />Nsehng nyia gbalee go mbang anyehng anyehng go etingitingi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 9:4</char></note> Ngbokambang, Esowo yake alum enye kak Jus go ebo. <verse eid="ROM 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3" />Anv, egom ji ki jo taame tv mee? Ekꞌtaame ebo ji bahke wahnge Esowo kꞌkpe bel ekakesehka?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 11:29; 2 Tim 2:13</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4" />Eꞌee, ano sang, Esowo li go etingitingi. Ane kpee ba kpo soodo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 3:4">Ana nwer Esowo bungu re, “O Esowo, alum nya a kpo bung, ane bahke nyehne re, lohko li go etingitingi. Bo lꞌkak-a elam, a bahke lehke eno.”<verse eid="ROM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5" />Alum nya n yahke bung a, n kpꞌbungu go mbang nyi ane kpo bung. Anv, abꞌbi enyahre lꞌtib re, Esowo li nne no ma li eno, e li ma bung re, Esowo ebsoodo, eji á kak-r erema? <verse eid="ROM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6" />Eꞌee. Li re li ano, kehn Esowo bahke ma lam njini renan? <verse eid="ROM 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7" />Anv, nsoodo enyame lꞌlim re, etingitingi ji Esowo kpe gbal na budu, fere ka-e ellub, jen ji wahnge á kp-m lungu re nne abiafem, fere jo ka-m ebi? <verse eid="ROM 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8" />Jen ji wahnge e lꞌkꞌlim abꞌbi, eji nnoobo lꞌlohng ona?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 11:50,53; Rom 6:1</char></note> Ane bandiki kpo kiimi afahnge, jo lak-r, fere jo ka-r ebi re, wahr ba kpo bung nsol nyia. Ebi ji bo bahke lehke, bo bahke lehke go nseenge.<verse eid="ROM 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nnene limm, no li go etingitingi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9" />Anv, wahr Jus, wahr ba ga nob sehnge ane baka bakaa? Eꞌee. M ma-n tohko tib re, Jus, a ane baka baka wob go elwo ni abiafem.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 2:9-10</char></note><verse eid="ROM 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10" />Ana nwer Esowo bungu no re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:10">“Jol nne na awohng ana wꞌwohng limm, no li go etingitingi.<verse eid="ROM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11" />Nnene limm, no kpꞌkahne.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:11">Nnene limm, no kpꞌsebe Esowo.<verse eid="ROM 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12" />Ane kpee ebsennge Esowo njahm.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:12">Bobtan mbang, bo ane kpee.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 5:12</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:12">Nnene limm, no kpo lim nnoobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:12">jol na awohng limm.<verse eid="ROM 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13" />Alum nnyo nya bo li ana esꞌsvv ji kpo lohng elahm bi bo ki bulu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:13">Nliki ebo nyi bo kpo ko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:13">jo nehm ane.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:13">Alum nnyo nya bo kpi afa ana nya enyo.<verse eid="ROM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14" />Anyo ebo li akuk akuk,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:14">a asabsab alum.<verse eid="ROM 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15" />Bo kpehme jahk ane wul.<verse eid="ROM 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16" />Edi ajehng ajehng ji bo lꞌje,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:16">elrannge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:16">a erem kpꞌtoono bo njahm.<verse eid="ROM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17" />Mbang elkoono bo nyimm.<verse eid="ROM 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18" />Bo kpehme fahl Esowo go mbang anyehng anyehng.”<verse eid="ROM 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19" />E kpꞌkahne re, ejum ajehng ajehng ji atahm bungu no li ka ane ba wob go elwo ni atahm,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Tim 1:9</char></note> eji nne awohng awohng lꞌkꞌting ejum ji á bahke laange kunu, eji njini kpee lꞌkahn re, bobgbo atahm nya Esowo.<verse eid="ROM 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20" />Tibre nnene limm, no bahke lehke eno go esamahr bi Esowo, tib eji á limi ji atahm bungu no.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 2:12; Gal 2:16</char></note> Tibre Esowo ka atahm, eji ane lꞌkahn re, bo li aneb abiafem.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 7:7</char></note><verse eid="ROM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana nne bahke ma li eno go esamahr bi Esowo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21" />Anv, Esowo ebtib ane mbang nyi bo bahke ma li eno go ege esamahr. Mbang nyio, mbang atahm sang. Atahm, a anyehnamahr Esowo yiimi ntianse re, <verse eid="ROM 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22" />ane kpo li eno go esamahr bi Esowo tib go eltaame ni bo kpꞌtaame tv Jisos Kraist. Eno jio li ka ane kpee ba lꞌtaame tv-e.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 10:43</char></note> Elyaange anyehng anyehng limm, <verse eid="ROM 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23" />tibre ane kpee eblim abiafem. Ellub ni Esowo ebrin bo.<verse eid="ROM 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24" />Anv, bobli eno tib go ayare nya nnoobo nyi Esowo, nya sehnge go abo nya Kraist Jisos ji ma fak bo yake,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ef 2:8</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25" />ye ji Esowo yak-e no ka, eji alung eme lꞌwahng eltim naang-e, á fere tahm ka bo go bo abiafem, bo lꞌtaame tv-e. Eji Esowo yake Jisos ka, á sebe re á tib mbang nyi ane bahke ma li eno go ege esamahr. Tibre wuku wuku Esowo jo kpuumu abiafem nya bo jo lim fere gbake bum go nkpe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 17:30</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26" />Wo anv, Esowo ebtib re, ye li go etingitingi, fere tib eno eje. Nne no lꞌtaame tv Jisos, ye wo bahke lehke eno go ege esamahr.<verse eid="ROM 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27" />Ejum aji e bahke woro nnyo kunu? Ejumjum. Jen ji wahnge? Tibre e kpehme bel eltahre tib go eltum alimi, e kpo bel eltahre tib go eltaame.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 1:31</char></note><verse eid="ROM 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28" />Tibre e kpꞌsahb bꞌbum re, nne bahke lehke eno tib go eltaame, á nehm li eno tib go atahm abumu. <verse eid="ROM 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29" />Anv, Esowo li Esowo bi Jus bi bia? Á tobem li Esowo bi ane baka baka fvfoa? Eꞌee, á tob li Esowo bi ane baka baka!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 10:12-13; Elt 11:17-18</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30" />Tibre Esowo li na abehng, bi bahke koko ane ba ma yehke nrur, a ba kil jo yehke nrur. Bo bahke lehke eno go ege esamahr tib go bo eltaame. <verse eid="ROM 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31" />Anv, wahr ebrange na atahm nya Moses tib go eltaame niaa? Eꞌee! E kpꞌyiimi atahm njahm.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 5:17; Rom 3:20</char></note><verse eid="ROM 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4" />
  <para style="s">Ana Pol ko Ebraham lim ntugare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1" />Jen ji e bahke bungu bade Ebraham nso ejahre, no e lohng go ege etꞌtohngo? <verse eid="ROM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2" />Li re Ebraham li eno go esamahr bi Esowo tib go nsol nyi á limi no, kehn á jol bele ejum ji á jol jo wor nnyo kunu. Go esamahr bi Esowo, nsol nyio, nyi nnyo aworo sang.<verse eid="ROM 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3" />Nwer Esowo bungu renan? Bungu re, “Ebraham taame tv Esowo. Owo wahnge Esowo fang-e kak go ellong ane ba ma li eno go ege esamahr.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gal 3:6</char></note><verse eid="ROM 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4" />Tibre nne no lꞌlim eltum, bo lꞌkpi-e, akpohko nyao bo we yarem na. Li ana mbong. <verse eid="ROM 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5" />Nne no kil jo lim eltum atahm, á lꞌbum Esowo go etingitingi, bi kpo lim abi ane, bo li eno, eltaame ene ni bahke wahnge Esowo ko-e ana nne no ma li eno.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 11:6; Mat 20:1-16</char></note><verse eid="ROM 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6" />Devid fvfo tob bungu bade elfuulu ni nne kpo bel, no Esowo m-e fange kak go ellong ane ba ma li eno, ba ki lim eltum atahm. <verse eid="ROM 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7" />Á bungu re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 4:7">“Elfuulu li a ane</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 4:7">ba Esowo ma tahm ka bo go bo abiafem,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 4:7">fere bulu abꞌbi ebo.<verse eid="ROM 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8" />Elfuulu li a nne</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 4:8">no Jehova kil ebkpe fange abiafem enye kak go nwer.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 18:24,27</char></note><verse eid="ROM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9" />Anv, elfuulu nia li ka ane ba ma yehke nrur ba baa, afi tob li ka ane ba kil jo yehke nrur? E kpꞌbungu re, Eltaame ni Ebraham taame no, ni wahnge Esowo fang-e no kak go ellong ane ba ma li eno. <verse eid="ROM 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10" />Ngare anyi ejum jia jolo no? Jolo ngare nyi Ebraham kala yehke nrura, afi ngare nyi á ma yehke nrur? Jolem ngare nyi á ma yehke nrur, jolo ngare nyi á kala yehke nrur. <verse eid="ROM 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11" />Esowo tong-e re, á yehke nrur, eji lꞌjol elliingi ni bahke wahnge á kahn re, yebli eno go esamahr bi Esowo tib go ege eltaame ni á taame no ngare nyi á kala yehke nrur. Owo wahnge eltaame ni á taame no ngare nyi á kala yehke nrur. Owo wahnge Ebraham ma jol nde no ane ba ma taame, ba kil jo yehke nrur, eji Esowo lꞌtob fange bo kak go ellong ane ba ma li eno. <verse eid="ROM 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12" />Á tob li nde no ane ba ma yehke nrur, ba ki yehke nrur nyi nyi, ba tob jo toono mbang eltaame ni Ebraham nso ejahre taame no ngare nyi á kala yehke nrur.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 3:9; Gal 3:28-29</char></note><verse eid="ROM 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eltaame ni Ebraham</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13" />Esowo nyame tong Ebraham, a abon ebe re bo bahke bele njini ana ejum elehke elkv. Tib eltaame ni Ebraham taame no ni wahnge Esowo ko-e ana nne no ma li eno. Esowo nyamem tong-e tib eji á jo bum atahm. <verse eid="ROM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14" />Li re ane ba kpo bum atahm bahke bele ji Esowo nyame no, kehn eltaame ejumjum limm, fvfo kehn enyam bi Esowo li mbol mbol. <verse eid="ROM 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15" />Tibre atahm kpo ko erakatahng ji Esowo ba a ji. Edi ji atahm ki li, owo atahm agboko kil jo jol.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 3:20; 5:13</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16" />Esowo nyame re, á bahke kake ane ba ma taame tv-e njini, eji lꞌjol ejum ayare ji nnoobo enye ka abon ba Ebraham kpee. Limm ka abon ba kpo bum atahm ba ba, tob li ka abon ba kpꞌtaame elkohn eltaame nio ni Ebraham. Tibre ye wo li nso ejahre, wahr ane kpee.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gal 3:18; Hib 11:8-12,17-19</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17" />Ana nwer Esowo bungu no re, “M ma-a lim re, wo jol nde no ajoobo ane tvv.” Ye wo li nso ejahre go esamahr bi Esowo, bi á taame tv-e, ye ji kpo ka akvne elkpin, fere lim nsol nyi kala jꞌjol.<verse eid="ROM 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18" />Ebraham taame tv Esowo, fere jo kunu ekpu go ejum ji kehn nne lꞌkꞌtiki kunu ekpu, ji jolo re, á bahke jolo nde no ajoobo ane tvv. Ana nwer Esowo bungu no re, “Abon eba bahke ruru sehng.”<verse eid="ROM 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19" />Ngare nyio sa ntiil Ebraham kang nnya atahl alon. Jol eltaame ene tikem gbod, jol eji á kahne re, yebkul sehng go mmon ajele, fere kahn re, Sera nkal ewe jolo ngum. <verse eid="ROM 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20" />Á tikem bel ekꞌtaame go ege eltim, fere faabe enyam bi Esowo. Á yiimi tꞌtahne go mbang nyi á taame no tv, fere jo ka Esowo ellub. <verse eid="ROM 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21" />Á sahb kꞌkahn re, nne no ma nyam tong-e bahke ma lim.<verse eid="ROM 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22" />Ano wo wahnge Esowo ko-e “ana nne no ma li eno tib go ege eltaame.” <verse eid="ROM 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23" />Alum Esowo nya bo nyono re, “Esowo ko Ebraham ana nne no ma li eno,” bo nyonem tib esi Ebraham ntahngtahng. <verse eid="ROM 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24" />Bo tob nyono tib wahr ji Esowo bahk-r tob ko ana ane ba ma li eno, wahr ji ma taame tv nne no nyahme Jisos Ntul ewahre go elkv,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gal 3:29</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25" />ye ji kpo no tib go egahre abiafem, Esowo fere nyahm-e go elkv, eji e lꞌli eno go ege esamahr.<verse eid="ROM 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5" />
  <para style="s">Nsol nyi Jisos limi ka-r</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1" />Anv, eji e ma li eno go esamahr bi Esowo tib go egahre eltaame, wahr ebjol go elkoono a Esowo, ni sehnge go abo nya Jisos Kraist ntul ewahre.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 14:27</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2" />Ye wo ma ba yang mbang ka-r, nyi li song kak go nnoobo nyi Esowo, nyi e yim no anv, fere kpꞌgeere kak ekunukpu re e bahke bele ellub ni Esowo.<verse eid="ROM 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3" />Jol ano ano sang, e kpꞌtob geere kak erem ebahre, tibre e kpꞌkahne re, erem kpo ko elkpuumu ba a ni.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jems 1:2-3</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4" />Elkpuumu kpo lim mbang Esowo jo kpuuru ane. Elkpuuru nio ni kpo ko ekunukpu ba a ji. <verse eid="ROM 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5" />Esowo bi e kp-e kunu ekpu, á nehm tiki kane. Tibre Esowo ebyaange Etingi Etohko kak go egahra ntim, ji á yar-r no ka. Owo wahng ka elkoro ni Esowo ma rur go egahra ntim.<verse eid="ROM 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6" />Ngare nyi e kpeke li na li, e ki kpi ekakebo ajehng ajehng, Kraist ba kpo go ngare nyi nno ka ane ba ki nyi Esowo. <verse eid="ROM 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7" />Bahke riidi re nne kehm kpoko go esi etingitingi nne. Fundiki nne nondiki bahke taame elkv go esi nnooba nne.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 11:16</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8" />Wo, Esowo ebtib ana wahr kp-e koro. Tibre ngare nyi e kpeke li aneb abiafem, Kraist ba kpo ka-r.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Jon 4:10</char></note><verse eid="ROM 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9" />Eji e ma li eno go esamahr bi Esowo tib go alung ma Jisos, lꞌlim renan, á ki-r tahre yehke go ege erakatahng?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Tes 5:9</char></note><verse eid="ROM 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10" />Ngare nyio nyi e jolo anebekv ba Esowo, Esowo ba limi etem a nahre tib go elkv ni Mmon ewe. Anv, eji e ma jol atem ba Esowo, bahke limi renan, e lꞌkꞌbel eltahre tib go ege elkpin? <verse eid="ROM 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11" />Jol ano ano sang, e kpꞌtob geere kak Esowo tib Jisos Kraist Ntul ewahre no ma-r lim re wahr jol go etem a Esowo.<verse eid="ROM 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Adam abola Kraist</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12" />Nne awohng wo wahnge abiafem ba go njini. Abiafem nyao nya ko elkv ba a ni. Elkv kehm sehnge ane kpee. Tibre ane kpee eblim abiafem.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 6:23</char></note><verse eid="ROM 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13" />Etingitingi, abiafem tohko jol go njini, Esowo kehm kake atahm. Atahm tohko jol, nnene nehm fange abiafem kak go nwer.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 4:15</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14" />Bomo ngare nyi Adam tete ba rehng ngare nyi Moses, elkv ni jo fili ane. Jo tob fili ane ba ki lim elkohn abiafem ana ni Adam limi no, ji jolo go elfoongo ni nne no kpꞌbake.<verse eid="ROM 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15" />Ane abal baa limm jang jang. Tibre ayare nya Esowo ka mbol mbol limm ana abiafem nya Adam. Ane gbalee ba ma kpo tib elsoodo ni nne awohng. Wo, nnoobo nyi Esowo nyi ga gbal, a ayare enye nya á ma yare ane gbalee ka mbol mbol tib nnoobo nyi nne noo na awohng, Jisos Kraist.<verse eid="ROM 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16" />Ayare nya Esowo ka mbol mbol limm jang jang ana abiafem nya nne noo na awohng. Tibre eji Esowo ma lam elsoodo nio na anehng, njini kpee ebli ebi. Wo anv, eji ane gbalee ma soodo nsoodo gbalee, Esowo ebka ayare enye, eji njini lꞌli eno. <verse eid="ROM 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17" />Elsoodo ni nne awohng ni wahnge elkv jo fili ane tib nne awohng noo. Wo anv, ane kpꞌbele nnoobo nyi Esowo nyi ma tv, a ayare enye nya á ka mbol mbol nya li eno alehke. Bo bahke tob bel elkpin, fere jol atul tib nne awohng noo no li Jisos Kraist.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 15:21-22,44-47</char></note><verse eid="ROM 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18" />Ana elsoodo ni nne awohng wahng re ane kpee li ebi, ano wo fvfo nne awohng no limi ejum ajehng ji jolo go etingitingi ma tob wahnge re ane kpee li eno, fere bel elkpin. <verse eid="ROM 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19" />Ana nne awohng no ki wuk Esowo limi re ane gbalee jol aneb abiafem, ano wo fvfo nne awohng no wuku Esowo ma tob lim, eji ane gbalee bahke lehke eno.<verse eid="ROM 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20" />Esowo ka atahm, eji ane lꞌkahn re abiafem ebtv sehng. Eji abiafem ma kpe tv, nnoobo ebkpe tv budu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gal 3:19</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21" />Ana abiafem jo fili ane go nsahm nyi elkv, ano wo fvfo nnoobo nyi Esowo kpꞌfili ane go nsahm nyi etingitingi, fere ka bo elkpin ni li go njinanjini ni sehnge go abo nya Jisos Kraist Ntul ewahre.<verse eid="ROM 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6" />
  <para style="s">Ewohngalahb lohngo rejen?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1" />Anv, ejum aji e bahken bꞌbung? Anv, nobo re wahr soro asi go abiafem, eji nnoobo lꞌtv-a?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 3:8</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2" />Eꞌee! Jen ji wahnge wahr ji ma kpo elkv ni e ma sehnge abiafem, bahke kpe lim elkpin ni abiafem? <verse eid="ROM 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3" />Ń nehme kahn re, wahr kpee ji ma bel ewohngalahb re wahr jol ajehng a Kraist Jisos, e bele ewohngalahb ji e ma kpo a nea?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gal 3:27</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4" />Ewohngalahb jia lohngo re, wahr ebkpo, bo ma-r kpa kak a ne, eji e lꞌjol go elkpin ni nfenfe, ana Kraist nyahme go elkv tib go ellub ni nde.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kol 2:12-13; 1 Pit 3:21</char></note><verse eid="ROM 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5" />Lꞌjol nyi e ma kpo ana ye, fere jol ajehng a ne go elkv ni á kpo no, e bahke tob nyahme ana ye, fere jol a ne go elkpin ni nfenfe. <verse eid="ROM 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6" />E kpꞌkahne re, nkꞌkulu elkpin enahre bobkum go ekros a Jisos eji elkpin enahre ni abiafem lꞌmal, e kꞌkpe jol aju nya abiafem.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gal 5:24</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7" />Tibre ye ji ma kpo ano ebfor go abiafem.<verse eid="ROM 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8" />Lꞌjol nyi e ma kpo a Kraist, e kpꞌbumu re, e bahke tob jol go elkpin a ne. <verse eid="ROM 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9" />Fvfo, e kpꞌkahne re, eji Kraist ma nyahme go elkv, á nehm kpe tiki kpo ekpokokpoko. Elkv, nsahm anyehng anyehng kpeem kpi nyi bahk-e ma kpe fili. <verse eid="ROM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10" />Elkv ni á kpo no, á kpo nkpelkpel anyehng sehnge abiafem. Wo, elkpin ni á li a ni anv, ni Esowo ni.<verse eid="ROM 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11" />Ano wo fvfo ḿ bahke tob rod elnahne bum ana ane ba ma kpo sehnge abiafem, fere bel elkpin ni Esowo ni li goji Kraist Jisos.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Kor 5:15</char></note><verse eid="ROM 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12" />Fvfo, nong, abiafem kꞌjo fili agubjing enyahne nya bahke kpoko, eji ń lꞌkꞌjo toono abi nsol nya kpo melle ane go bo a ntim. <verse eid="ROM 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13" />Kana tiki yake ejum ngubjing ajehng ajehng tv abiafem, eji nnehm lꞌkꞌrod, jo lim abꞌbi. Yaken elnahne ka Esowo ana ane ba bo ma yehke bo go elkv, feere a bo go elkpin. Yaken agubjing enyahne ka Esowo, eji á lꞌrod, jo lim nsol nyi li go etingitingi.<verse eid="ROM 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14" />Tibre abiafem wahn nehm kpe jo fili, eji ń ki kpe wob go elwo ni atahm, ń fere wob go elwo ni nnoobo nyi Esowo.<verse eid="ROM 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Anv, wo nju nyi nyehne nyi?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15" />Anv, jen ji e bahke limi? Wahr lim abiafema, tib eji e ki wob go elwo ni atahma, e wob go elwo ni nnoobo nyi Esowoa? Eꞌee! Nong, kꞌjol ano!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Pit 2:16</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16" />Ń nehme kahn re, nne no ń lꞌyake elnahne ka-e ana aju, fere jo lok-e, ye ji ń kp-e loko, ye wo ń li aju enyea?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 8:34</char></note> Ń lꞌjol aju nya abiafem, nsehng enyahne, elkv ni. Ń lꞌfere jol aju nya Esowo, fere jo lok-e, nsehng enyahne nyi ḿ bahke lehke, ḿ bahke lehke eno go esamahr bi Esowo. <verse eid="ROM 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17" />Me n kak Esowo saam, tibre wuku wuku ń jolo aju nya abiafem, wo anv, wahn ebfere jol ane ba kpꞌtoono etingitingi eltibi a ntim a ntim enyahne kpee, ni ḿ ma yake elnahne ka. <verse eid="ROM 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18" />Esowo ma-n lim, wahn eblohng go abiafem, fere for. Wahn ebfere jol aju nya nsol nyi li go etingitingi. <verse eid="ROM 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19" />Mbang nyi nne nyi n kpꞌbungu a. Tibre n tohko bung ano, ń nehm kahn ana lohngo no. Wuku wuku ń yake agubjing enyahne ka, fere jol aju nya nsol nyi ki li saang, ń jo gbale go abꞌbi. Anv, yaken agubjing enyahne ka, wahn fere jol aju nya nsol nyi li go etingitingi, eji ń lꞌjol ejahne ejahne.<verse eid="ROM 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20" />Tibre ngare nyi ń jolo aju nya abiafem, ń joom ma lim nsol nyi li go etingitingi. <verse eid="ROM 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21" />Anv, nsehng anyi ń jo li, eji ń jo lim nsol nyio nyi wahnge ndon kp-n fili anv? Tibre ane ba kpo lim nsol nyia, esꞌkohlo ebo, elkv ni.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 8:13</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22" />Anv, eji Esowo ma-n tahre yehke go abiafem, wahn ebfere jol aju enye, nsehng enyahne nyi ḿ bahke lehke, nyi nyi li re, ḿ bahke jolo ejahne ejahne ka Esowo. Esꞌkohlo, ḿ bahke bele elkpin ni li go njinanjini. <verse eid="ROM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23" />Tibre nsehng nyi abiafem, elkv ni. Ayare nya Esowo ka-r mbol mbol, elkpin ni li go njinanjini ni, ni sehnge go abo nya Jisos Kraist Ntul ewahre.<verse eid="ROM 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7" />
  <para style="s">Ntugare nyi li bade elbal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1" />Abonanee, ń kpꞌkahne ji n yahke ba elbungu, tibre n kpꞌbungu a ane ba kpꞌkahne atahm. Ngare nyi nne kpeke li go elkpin, nyi nyi á kpo woomo go elwo ni atahm. <verse eid="ROM 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2" />Ana nnenkal no kpi nlum, ntahm li re, nnenkal noo bahke tiki jol ajehng a nlum ewe, ngare nyi nlum ewe kpeke li go elkpin. Wo, nnenlum lꞌkpo, nnenkal ebfor go ntahm nyi limi bo re bo jol ajehng. <verse eid="ROM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3" />Á lꞌtahm song bal nnenlum nondiki, eji nlum ewe kpeke li go elkpin, bo bahke jo lung-e re nlimerehbe. Nlum ewe lꞌkpo, yebfor go ntahm nyio. Á lꞌfere song bal nnenlum nondiki, ye nlimerehbe sang.<verse eid="ROM 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4" />Abonanee, ano wo fvfo ḿ ma tob kpo, lohng go elwo ni atahm tib go ngubjing nyi Kraist, eji ń lꞌjol ka ye ji ma nyahme go elkv, fere kab akab ka Esowo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hib 2:14-15; 9:16-17</char></note><verse eid="ROM 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5" />Ngare nyi e jolo ka ngubjing, atahm nya wahnge ekor abiafem jo mell-r go egahra ntim, jo lim eltum go egahre agubjing re jo kab akab ka elkv. <verse eid="ROM 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6" />Wo anv, wahr ebfor go atahm, eji e ma kpo, lohng go elwo ni ejum ji fil-r no, eji e lꞌkꞌkpe loko Esowo go nkꞌkula mbang ana nyi bo nyono go atahm, e lꞌfere lok-e go mbang nyi nfenfe nyi etohko ji Esowo kpo tib.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 6:4; 8:1-2</char></note><verse eid="ROM 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana atahm lohngo no</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7" />Ejum aji e bahke bungu? E bahke bungu re, atahm ejum abiafem jia? Eꞌee, ano sang li no. Tibre ki li atahm, kehn n jolem kahne ana abiafem li li. Ki li ntahm bungu no re, “Ka jo baare amahr go ejum nne!” kehn n jolem kahne ana amahr abaare li li.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 3:20</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8" />Atahm nya wahnge abiafem bele eyake, jo mell-m go eltim. Owo wahnge n jo baare amahr go nsol kpee. Ki li atahm, kehn abiafem ekpakv ejum ji.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 5:13</char></note><verse eid="ROM 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9" />Wuku wuku eji n ki kahn atahm, n jolo go elkpin. Wo eji atahm ba no, abiafem kehm nyamme, toono o, n kpo. <verse eid="ROM 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10" />Atahm nya kehn jol koko elkpin ba a ni, nya nya ma fere wahng m ma kpo. <verse eid="ROM 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11" />Atahm nya wahnge abiafem bele eyake ba nehm-m, fere ko atahm ba wul-m.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jems 1:15</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12" />Etingitingi, atahm li saang. Nsol kpee nyi atahm bungu no li saang, li go etingitingi, fere nꞌnob.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Tim 1:8</char></note><verse eid="ROM 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13" />Anv, lohngo re nnoobo ejum nyi ma ko elkv ba ka-ma? Eꞌee, ano sang. Abiafem nya wahnge no. Tibre abiafem ko ejum ji kpꞌnobo ba wul-m, eji ane lꞌlohko nyehn re, abiafem lohko li abiafem, eji atahm lꞌfere tib re, abiafem sabe sꞌsehng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 5:20</char></note><verse eid="ROM 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisos wo ma-r lim re wahr for go abiafem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14" />E kpꞌkahne re, atahm, ejum etohko ji. Wo, me n li ka ngubjing nyi nyi. Bo ko-m, gungu abiafem ana nju. <verse eid="ROM 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15" />N nehme kahn ji n kpo lꞌlim. Tibre n kpehme lim ji kpo kor-m re me n lim. N kpo lim ji kpo sab-m. <verse eid="ROM 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16" />N lꞌlim ji ki-m kor re me n lim, lohngo re me n taame re, atahm kpꞌnobo.<verse eid="ROM 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17" />Fvfo, mefono antahng sang kpꞌlimi ano. Abiafem nya wob-m go atahng nya kpꞌlimi. <verse eid="ROM 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18" />Tibre n kpꞌkahne re, ejum ji nno ajehng ajehng limm, ji wob-m go atahng, ji li go egama ngubjing. Kpo kor-m re me n lim ji kpꞌnobo, wo, n kpehme ma lim. <verse eid="ROM 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19" />Tibre n kpehme lim nnoobo nyi n kpꞌsebe re me n lim. Abꞌbi nya n kil sebe re me n lim, nya nya n kpo fere lim. <verse eid="ROM 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20" />N lꞌlim ji ki-m kor re me n lim, lohngo re mefono antahng sang limi, abiafem nya wob-m go atahng nya.<verse eid="ROM 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21" />Ana wo kpo kono eljolo. N lꞌtahm re me n lim ji kpꞌnobo, abiafem li a name o. <verse eid="ROM 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22" />Atahm nya Esowo kpo yeb-m go atahng. <verse eid="ROM 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23" />Me n kpe nyehn ntahm nyehko nyi wob go egama ngubjing, nyi li ntahm abiafem, nyi nyi ma-m lim nne a ngbekobo ewe, ebfere kpꞌnoko ebta a ntahm nyi kpo yeb-m go atahng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gal 5:17</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24" />Nyehn ana n li erem erem!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 5:3,6; 11:28</char></note> Nne awo bahk-m tahre yehke go elwo ni ntahm nyi wahnge ngubjing enyame bahke kpoko? <verse eid="ROM 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25" />Me n kak Esowo saam, Jisos Kraist Ntul ewahre wo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 15:57</char></note> Ana wo eljini ename li no. Etingitingi, mefono antahng n kpo bum ntahm nyi Esowo go egame atahng. Ngubjing enyame kpo bum ntahm nyi abiafem.<verse eid="ROM 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8" />
  <para style="s">Elkpin nfenfe ni etohko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1" />Fvfo, ane ba li ka Kraist Jisos nehm kpe li ebi ajehng ajehng go esamahr bi Esowo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 3:22</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2" />Tibre ntahm nyi etohko jio ji kpo ka elkpin ni Kraist Jisos, nyi nyi ma-m lim, m ma for go ntahm nyio nyi abiafem, fere for go elkv.<verse eid="ROM 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3" />Tibre Esowo eblim ji atahm ki ma lim, tib eji ngubjing kpꞌleenge.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 13:39</char></note> Esowo tumu Mmon ewe antahng antahng ana nne no kpi ngubjing nyi abiafem. Á tum-e tib go esi ji abiafem, eji á lꞌka abiafem ebi go ngubjing nyi Jisos.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gal 3:13</char></note><verse eid="ROM 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4" />Eji Esowo limi ano, á limi kpee ji atahm bungu no, biingi go nseenge ka-r,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 5:17</char></note> wahr ji kpꞌjene go mbang nyi etohko, e kil eljene go mbang nyi ngubjing.<verse eid="ROM 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5" />Ane ba li go elkpin ni ngubjing, bo kpo yehke amahr ebo kunu go nsol nyi li ka ngubjing. Ane ba li go elkpin ni etohko, bo kpo yehke amahr ebo kunu go nsol nyi li ka etohko.<verse eid="ROM 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6" />Nne lꞌyehke amahr enye kunu go nsol nyi li ka ngubjing, o mbang elkv nyi. Nne lꞌyehke amahr enye kunu go nsol nyi li ka etohko, o mbang elkpin nyi, a nyi elkoono. <verse eid="ROM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7" />Tibre nne no lꞌyehke amahr enye kunu go nsol nyi li ka ngubjing, á li nnekv no Esowo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jems 4:4</char></note> Á kpehme bum atahm nya Esowo, jol á nehm ma tiki bum. <verse eid="ROM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8" />Ane ba li ka ngubjing kpehme kor Esowo. <verse eid="ROM 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9" />Wo, wahn limm ka ngubjing, ń li ka etohko, lꞌjol nyi etohko ji Esowo lohk-n wob go atahng. Nne awohng awohng no ki kpi etohko ji Kraist, ye nne ewe sang.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 11:9,13</char></note><verse eid="ROM 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10" />Kraist lꞌwoom-n go egahne atahng, afi ngubjing enyahne ebkpo tib abiafem, atohko enyahne nyaa go elkpin, tibre wahn ebli eno go esamahr bi Esowo. <verse eid="ROM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11" />Etohko ji nne no nyahme Jisos go elkv lꞌwoom-n go egahne atahng, owo nne no nyahme Kraist Jisos go elkv bahke koko etohko eje ji wob-n go egahne atahng, ka agubjing enyahne nya bahke kpoko elkpin.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fil 3:21</char></note><verse eid="ROM 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12" />Abonanee, e kpi mbong. Ngubjing sang e kpi-e mbong nyi bahke wahnge e jol ka-e. <verse eid="ROM 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13" />Tibre ń lꞌjol go elkpin ni koro ngubjing, ḿ bahke kpoko. Ń lꞌfere ko etohko, jo wul nsol nyi li ka ngubjing, ḿ bahke bele elkpin.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kol 3:5</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14" />Tibre ane kpee ba kpꞌjene go mbang nyi Etingi Etohko kpꞌtibi bo, bo ba li abon ba Esowo.<verse eid="ROM 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15" />Ḿ belem etohko ji lim-n, ń jol aju, fere kpe jo kehme elfahle. Ḿ bele etohko ji lim-n, ń jol abon ba Esowo, fere jo rabe re, “Abba, Nsoo!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Jon 4:17-18</char></note><verse eid="ROM 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16" />Etohko ji Esowo, a etohko jꞌjahre kpo yiimi ntianse re, wahr abon Esowo ba. <verse eid="ROM 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17" />Eji e li abon ebe, e tob li abalehkelkv ba Esowo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gal 4:6-7</char></note> E bahke lehke elkv ano a Kraist. Tibre etingitingi, e lꞌnyehn erem a ne, e bahke tob bel ellub a ne.<verse eid="ROM 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ellub ni bahke jolo go esꞌsong</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18" />N kpꞌtiri re, erem bi e kpꞌnyehne anv, ebse sehng, jol nne nehm ma ko gare a ellub ni Esowo bahke lennge ka-r.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Kor 4:17</char></note><verse eid="ROM 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19" />Tibre nsol nyi Esowo limi no kpee kpꞌsahb sꞌsik efung bi Esowo bahke lennge abon ebe. <verse eid="ROM 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20" />Tibre nsol nyi Esowo limi no wob go elwo ni elkv. Lohngem re bo sebe re bo jol ano. Esowo bi kake bo go elwo nio, fere ka bo ekunukpu ji <verse eid="ROM 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21" />bo bahke foro go eju bio bi elrannge, ana abon Esowo bahke foro, fere bel ellub.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Pit 3:13</char></note><verse eid="ROM 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22" />E kpꞌkahne re, nsol nyi Esowo limi no kpee kpi ntahnge ntahnge etahng ejel tete sik anv. <verse eid="ROM 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23" />Nsol nyio nyi nyi sang, wahr ji kpi Etingi Etohko ji Esowo ka-r no ana ngbokambang ayare, e kpꞌtob tahng go egahre atahng, eji e kpꞌsiki Esowo re á lim-r, wahr jol abon ebe, fere fak agubjing enyahre yake.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Kor 5:2</char></note><verse eid="ROM 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24" />Tibre wahr ebbel eltahre ana ejum ji e kpꞌkunu ekpu. E lꞌnyehn ji e kpꞌkunu ekpu, o ekunukpu sang. Nne awo no kpo kunu ekpu go ejum ji á kpꞌnyehne?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Kor 5:7</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25" />E kpo kunu ekpu go ejum ji e kil elnyehne, fere kpooro, jo sik. <verse eid="ROM 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26" />Mbang nyꞌnehm nyi Etingi Etohko kpo kak-r ebo, wahr jia ji kpꞌleenge. Tibre e nehme kahn ana fuumu re wahr jo kak ero. Etingi Etohko antahng antahng ji kpo gboongo Esowo ka-r go mbang nyi nne lꞌkꞌma bung go nnyo.<verse eid="ROM 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27" />Esowo bi kpo rab ntim ane, á kpꞌkahne ntir atahng nyi Etingi Etohko. Tibre Etingi Etohko ji kpo gboongo Esowo ka aneb Esowo go mbang nyi kpo kor Esowo. <verse eid="ROM 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28" />E kpꞌkahne re, nsol kpee kpo jen a nnoobo ka ane ba Esowo kpi bo kor, bo jio ji á ma lung bo ana á toobo no. <verse eid="ROM 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29" />Tibre ane ba á kahne bo wuku wuku, á tob yehke bo re bo jol go elfoongo ni mmon ewe, eji Mmon ewe lꞌjol ngbokambang a mmon go ellong abonanyehn ba li gbalee. <verse eid="ROM 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30" />Ane ba á ma jak bo, yebtob lung bo. Bo ji á lungu bo, á limi bo re bo jol atingitingi ane go ege esamahr. Ane ba á ma lim bo re bo jol atingitingi ane, yebtob ka bo ellub ene.<verse eid="ROM 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ejumjum limm, ji bahk-r ma yaame go elkoro ni e kpꞌkoro Esowo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31" />Anv, eyaame jia e bahke bungu renan? Eji Esowo li a nahre, nne awo bahke kpe mal a nahre? <verse eid="ROM 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32" />Ye ji ki nok Mmon ewe bum, á yak-e no ka tib go egahre esi, wahr ane kpee, anv, wahr á nehm tob ka nsol kpee buda?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 3:16</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33" />Nne awo bahke ma ka ane ba Esowo ma yehke ebi?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ell 12:10</char></note> Esowo bi ma bung re, bobli eno! <verse eid="ROM 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34" />Nne awo bahke ma bung re, bobli ebi? Kraist Jisos wo kpo no, fere nyahme go elkv, ye jio ji jehk go eboblum Esowo kpꞌgboongo Esowo ka-r.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Jon 2:1</char></note><verse eid="ROM 8:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35" />Nne awo bahk-r ma yaame go elkoro ni e kpꞌkoro Kraist? Anv, erem bahk-r ma yaama, afi afemfem, afi ebnohko, afi njal, afi ekpak, afi efin, afi elkv?<verse eid="ROM 8:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36" />Ana nwer Esowo bungu no re, “Tib go ega esi wo e kpꞌkpoko efung kohro kohro. Bo kp-r bumu ana ejoro bi bo bahke wulu.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Kor 4:11</char></note><verse eid="ROM 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37" />E kpꞌsehnge nsol nyia kpee, fere yiimi go nsahm nyi Kraist ji e kor-e no. <verse eid="ROM 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38" />N kpꞌsahb kꞌkahn re, ejumjum limm, ji bahk-r ma yaame go elkoro ni e kpꞌkoro Esowo, afi jolo elkv, afi fere jolo elkpin, afi jolo babenjel, afi fere jol atubesi ba li go ejahbetul Esowo, afi jolo ba li ga njini, afi fere jolo nsol nyi li anv, afi nyi kpꞌbake, <verse eid="ROM 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39" />afi jolo nsol nyi li go ero, afi nyi li ga ndi, afi fere jolo ejum ajehng ajehng jehko ji Esowo limi no. Nsol nyia kpee wahr nehm ma yaame go elkoro ni e kpꞌkoro Esowo, ni li goji Kraist Jisos Ntul ewahre.<verse eid="ROM 8:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9" />
  <para style="s">Ane ba Esowo jake no yehke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1" />N kpꞌbungu go etingitingi. N li ka Kraist, efahnge sang n kpꞌkimi. Ntir atahng enyame nyi Etingi Etohko wob no kp-m yiimi ntianse re, <verse eid="ROM 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2" />eltim ename ebgbal ndon ndon.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 19:41</char></note> Ala kpi-m nteele nteele. <verse eid="ROM 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3" />Tibre mefono antahng, n jo sahb sꞌseb re me n jol ejum nkuk, fere yaame a Kraist tib esi ji abonanee ba e lohng ano a bo, <verse eid="ROM 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4" />ba li abon Israel, ba Esowo ko bo ana abon ebe, fere ka bo ellub ene, a agbanngalung enye, a atahm, fere tib bo ana bo bahke jo kak-e, fere nyam anyam tong bo. <verse eid="ROM 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5" />Bo lohng etꞌtohngo ajehng a babnso ejahre ba mahne mahne. Go eyaame ji ngubjing, Kraist tob lohng ano a bo, ye ji ejum ajehng ajehng wob-e go elwo, ye ji li Esowo bi e kp-e tehke go njinanjini. Emen.<verse eid="ROM 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6" />Ane kpee ba lohng go etꞌtohngo ji Israel sang li ane ba Esowo yehke no.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 2:28</char></note> Jia lohngem re, alum Esowo ebfere jol mbol mbol. <verse eid="ROM 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7" />Ane kpee ba lohng go etꞌtohngo ji Ebraham sang li abon ba Ebraham. Tibre Esowo tongo Ebraham re, “Ane ba bahke lohngo go etꞌtohngo ji Aisik ba ba, bo bahke jo lung bo re abon eba.” <verse eid="ROM 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8" />Jia lohngo re, abon ba bo jele bo go mbang nyehka nyehka sang li abon Esowo. Abon ba Esowo nyame no tong re bo bahke jele bo, bo ba li atingitingi abon.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gal 4:23</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9" />Tibre ana wo Esowo nyame no re, “Yabv, ngare nyꞌnehm ana nyi m bahke feere. N lꞌba, Sera ebjel mmon.”<verse eid="ROM 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10" />Jol ye ntahngtahng sang. Ejum jꞌnehm a, ji tob lim Rebekka nkal Aisik, nso ejahre, ngare nyi á sa ela. <verse eid="ROM 9:10" /><verse number="11-12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11-12" />Ngare nyio á ka jel abon bao. Jol ejumjum bo ka lim ji kpꞌsabe, a ji kpꞌnobo. Esowo tongo Rebekka re, “Ngbokambang a mmon bahke jo loko nkalla,” eji ntoobo nyi Esowo lꞌyiimi, ye ji kpo lung ane ba á ma yehke bo. Esowo kpehme yehke ane tib go eltum ni bo kpꞌlimi. <verse eid="ROM 9:11-12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13" />Ana nwer Esowo bungu no re, “Jekob wo jo kor-m, Eso jo sab-m.”<verse eid="ROM 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14" />Anv, e bahke bungu renan? Esowo limm go etingitinga? Eꞌee, ano sang!<verse eid="ROM 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15" />Tibre á bungu tong Moses re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:15">“Nne no lꞌkor-m, ye wo m bahke tahme ka-e.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:15">Nne no lꞌkor-m wo bahk-m fili ndon.”<verse eid="ROM 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16" />Fvfo, ane ba Esowo kpo yehke, bo limm ane ba kpo kor na bo. Jol bo limm ane ba kpo lim eltum tib esi jio. Esowo kpo yehke ane ba kpo fil-e ndon.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ef 2:8-9</char></note><verse eid="ROM 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17" />Tibre nwer Esowo bungu tong Fero re, “M bob-a etul, eji n lꞌko-a, jo tib nsahm enyame, mbing enyame fere lohng go njini kpee.”<verse eid="ROM 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18" />Fvfo, Esowo, nne no kor-e no, ye wo kpo fil-e ndon. Á kpo lim ane bel etahnsi ana kor-e no.<verse eid="ROM 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Erakatahng ji Esowo, a ndon enye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19" />Nne ewahne awohng li-m ma tong re, “Jen ji wahnge Esowo kpo ka nne ebi? Nne awo bahke ma kpan Esowo go nsol nyi á kpꞌlimi?” <verse eid="ROM 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20" />Mbi, anv, wo elkohn nne awo no bahke ma faange Esowo go nnyo? Anv, etu kpo bahb ntꞌtoko re, “Jen ji wahnge a ma-m to ana?” <verse eid="ROM 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21" />Ntokatu sang kpi nsahm nyi á bahke koko ndi, to etu ana kor-e noa? Á li ma ko ndi nyꞌnehm ona nyi á ma mong, to etu ji nno, a ji kpꞌsabe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Tim 2:20</char></note><verse eid="ROM 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22" />Kpo kor Esowo re á tib erakatahng eje, fere lim ane kahn re á kpi nsahm. Owo wahnge á kpo kpuumu, fere jo kpooro tib go esi ane ba kpo lim re atahng jo rak-e, bo jio ji á ma toobo bo bum re á rannge bo,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Pit 3:9</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23" />eji á lꞌlim ane kahn afang nyao nya ellub ene ni á bahke kake ane ba jo fil-e ndon, bo ji á ma toobo bo bum re bo bel ellub ene.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ef 1:3-14</char></note><verse eid="ROM 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24" />Wahr ba li ane bao ba á ma lung, Jus ji ji sang, ane baka baka fvfo.<verse eid="ROM 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25" />Ana Esowo bungu sehng go nnyo mi nnyehnamahr Hosea re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">“Ane ba ki jol ane ebame,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">m bahke lungu bo re ane ebame.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">Nnenkal no ki-m jo kor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">m bahke jo lung-e re Akor-m.<verse eid="ROM 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26" />Edi ji bo tongo bo re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:26">wahn ane ebame sang!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:26">Edi jꞌnehm ona ji, bo bahke fere jo lung bo re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:26">abon ba Esowo bi li go elkpin.”<verse eid="ROM 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27" />Aisaya jo rabe bade Israel re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:27">“Abon Israel lꞌrur ana asahknti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:27">ebsake bi bi bahke bele eltahre.<verse eid="ROM 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28" />Tibre Jehova bahke gohro lam ejahbe jio elwaare elwaare.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:28">Elam eje bahke jolo ji nno.”<verse eid="ROM 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29" />Ana Aisaya tohko bung re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:29">“Ki li re Esowo bi Sebaot tahre ebsake bum,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:29">kehn wahr ebfere jol ana Sodom, a Gomorra.”<verse eid="ROM 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30" />Anv, ejum aji e bahke bungu? Ane baka baka ba ki jo seb re bo li eno go esamahr bi Esowo, bobli eno ji ane ba ma taame kpo li. <verse eid="ROM 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31" />Wo, abon Israel ba Esowo yehke bo, bo jo noko re bo li eno ji ane ba kpo bum atahm kpo li. Jol bo liim.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 3:22; 10:20-21</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32" />Jen ji wahnge bo ki li eno? Tibre bo jo gare re bo li eno go eltum atahm abumu, go eltaame sang. Owo bo kehm sele gbo go eltal elsele nio ni li Jisos, <verse eid="ROM 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33" />ni nwer Esowo bungu no re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">“Nyehnen, n kpꞌbumu eltal go Sayon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">ni ane bahke jo seele.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">Ekpartal jio wo, bo bahke jo gbo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">Nne no lꞌtaame tv-e,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">bo we nehm riki ndon.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 21:42-46</char></note><verse eid="ROM 9:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10" />
  <para style="s">Eying ji atahm ebmal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1" />Abonanee, ntir enyame ga li re Israel bel eltahre. Ejum ji o ji, n kpo kak ero ka Esowo. <verse eid="ROM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2" />N kpꞌyiimi bo ntianse re bo kpo kak ekpuku go eltum Esowo alimi, wo, bo kpo lim aji aji.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 23:15</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3" />Bo joom kahn eno alehke ji Esowo. Eji bo jo gare re bo li eno go bo a ngang antahng, bo tene eno ji Esowo. <verse eid="ROM 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4" />Tib eji Kraist ma ba, eying ji atahm ebmal. Nne awohng awohng no lꞌtaame tv-e, á bahke lehke eno go esamahr bi Esowo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 5:17; Jon 3:18; Hib 8:13</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5" />Moses bungu bade eno alehke ji atahm re, “Nne no lꞌbum atahm, atahm nya bahke wahnge á bel elkpin.”<verse eid="ROM 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6" />Nwer Esowo bungu bade eno alehke ji eltaame re, “Ka jo bung go ega eltim re, ‘Nne awo bahke wahre song rehng go ejahbetul?’ ” Jia lohngo re, á song ko Kraist badde a ne.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mak 10:27</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7" />“Ka bung re, ‘Nne awo bahke badde song rehng ejahbe akvne?’ ” Jia lohngo re, á song nyahme Kraist ba a ne.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 8:3</char></note><verse eid="ROM 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8" />Anv, nwer Esowo bungu renan? Bungu re, “Alum Esowo li a na bad bad, kun-a go nnyo rib rib, fere wob-a go eltim.” Alum nyaa alum eltaame nya, nya e kpo bung.<verse eid="ROM 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9" />Tibre a lꞌfere yiimi ntianse re, “Jisos Ntul wo,” fere taame go ega eltim re, “Esowo nyahm-e nyahme go elkv,” a bahke bele eltahre. <verse eid="ROM 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10" />Tibre nne no ma taame go ege eltim, ye wo ma li eno go esamahr bi Esowo. Nne no kpꞌyiimi ntianse ka Jisos, ye wo ma bel eltahre.<verse eid="ROM 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11" />Tibre nwer Esowo bungu re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:11">“Nne awohng awohng no lꞌtaame tv-e,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:11">bo we nehm riki ndon.”<verse eid="ROM 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12" />Elyaange anehng anehng limm, afi jolo Jus, afi jolo Grik. Ntul nonehm wo li Ntul no ane kpee, no kpo ka ane afang enye, ba lꞌgboong-e go ege a mbing.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 10:34</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13" />Ana nwer Esowo bungu no re, “Nne awohng awohng no lꞌgboongo Esowo go mbing nyi Ntul, á bahke bele eltahre.”<verse eid="ROM 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Anebe Israel, a ane baka baka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14" />Anv, ane bahke limi renan kehm gboongo Esowo, eji bo kala taame tv-e? Bo bahke limi renan kehm taame tv-e, eji bo kala wꞌwuk bada ne? <verse eid="ROM 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15" />Anv, ane bahke limi renan kehm bungu alum Esowo, eji bo ki tum bo?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 20:21; Mat 28:19-20</char></note> Ana nwer Esowo bungu no re, “Elbake ni ane ba kpo tiingi nnoobo etib kpꞌbake, emnob sehng.”<verse eid="ROM 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16" />Ane kpee sang ma taame tv nnoobo etib bio. Tibre Aisaya bungu re, “Ntul, nne awo no ma taame tv etib ebahre bi e tiingi no?”<verse eid="ROM 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17" />Eltaame kpo lohng go elwuku ni ane kpꞌwuku nnoobo etib. Nnoobo etib bio kpo lohng go alum nya Kraist.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 17:20</char></note><verse eid="ROM 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18" />N kpꞌbahbe re, Anv, bo ka wuk etib bioa? Eꞌee, bobwuk! Ana nwer Esowo bungu no re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:18">“Alum nya alokeltum Esowo bungu no ebgan go njini kpee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:18">ebyeere rehng nkpohka njini anyehng anyehng.”<verse eid="ROM 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19" />N kpꞌkpeke bahb re, Anv, abone Israel kahnem ana lohngo noa? Moses gbo mbang bung re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">“M bahke limi, aneb mbol mbol jo teel-n ala.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">M bahke koko agboolo ane, jo lim atahng jo rak-n.”<verse eid="ROM 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20" />Aisaya tob bungu a esahb esahb re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:20">“Ane ba ki-m jo seb,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:20">bo ma-m nyehn.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:20">Me n lennge elname tib ane ba n ki jo lub bo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 9:30</char></note><verse eid="ROM 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21" />Esowo bungu bada Israel re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:21">“Efung kohro kohro bi n nyange abo enyame</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:21">re me n vvrv ane ba ki-m jo wuk,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:21">ba jo faang-m go nnyo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 23:37</char></note><verse eid="ROM 10:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11" />
  <para style="s">Anv, Esowo ebten na Israela?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1" />N kpꞌbahbe re, anv, Esowo ebten ane ebea? Eꞌee! Mefono antahng, me nne Israel wo. Me mmon no Ebraham wo. N lohng go etꞌtohngo ji Benjamin.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fil 3:5-8; 1 Tim 1:13</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2" />Esowo ka ten ane ebe, ba á tohko kahn bo, bo kehm jini. Ń nehme kahn edi nwer Esowo ji Elaija bungu a Esowo bada Israela?<verse eid="ROM 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3" />Á bungu re, “Ntul, bobwul abanyehnamahr eba, fere wa adi njom alimi enya. Me n sa ntahngtahng, gana bo kpꞌsebe re bo wul-m.”<verse eid="ROM 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4" />Anv, Esowo faang-e renan? Á faang-e re, “Me n kuuru ane atahltahl nkpel elkubal ane atahl awubu (7,000) bum elname, ba kala jamme alahng, kak Baal.”<verse eid="ROM 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5" />Ano wo fvfo tob li ngare nyꞌnehm ana. Ebsake ane ba Esowo ma yehke tib go ege a nnoobo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 9:27</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6" />Lꞌfere jol re á yehke bo tib go ege a nnoobo, o lohngo re, go bo eltum sang. Tohko jol ano, nnoobo kpeem li nnoobo.<verse eid="ROM 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7" />Jia lohngo renan? Israel tikem bel ji bo jo seb. Ane ba Esowo yehke bo ba bele. Erik ane jehko bele etahnsi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 9:31</char></note><verse eid="ROM 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8" />Ana nwer Esowo bungu no re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:8">“Esowo ebkak bo etohko jio ji ellu alale,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:8">fere kak bo amahr nya bo lꞌkꞌkpe jo nyehn,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:8">fere ka bo atung nya bo lꞌkꞌkpe jo wuk tete rehng lela.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 13:14-15; 2 Tes 2:10-12</char></note><verse eid="ROM 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9" />Devid kpe bung re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:9">“Nong, nkak ebo nyi bo kpo lim siingi nlehke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:9">a ekpoko ji bo bahke gboko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:9">a esiti mbang ji bo bahke seele,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:9">eji lꞌjol eltuuru ebo.<verse eid="ROM 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10" />Nong, amahr ebo bamme,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:10">eji bo lꞌkꞌkpe jo nyehn.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:10">Si bo elsol ni nnen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:10">bo jo jen ano ngare anyehng anyehng.”<verse eid="ROM 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11" />N kpꞌbahbe re, Anv, bobsel elsel ni bo bahke gboka? Eꞌee! Ebꞌbi ebo ji wahnge eltahre ma rehng goji ane baka baka, eji bo lꞌjo teele Israel ala. <verse eid="ROM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12" />Eji abiafem nya Israel ko afang ba ka njini, fvfo ekpak bi bo gbo no bi ma lim ane baka baka ma gbo afang, elfuulu bahke gbale sehng ngare nyi Israel kpee bahke feere goji Esowo.<verse eid="ROM 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana ane baka baka bele eltahre</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13" />Anv, n kpꞌbungu a nahne wahn ji ki li abone Israel. Eji n li ntiingetib no Esowo tum-m tv ane baka baka, n kpꞌgeere kak eltum ename, <verse eid="ROM 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14" />eji limi limi kan n lꞌlim ala jo teele ejahbe ejame, n fere tahre egom ebo jindiki.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 13:46-47</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15" />Tibre eji eltene ni Esowo tene Israel limi re, njini jol go etem a Esowo, jen ji bahke jolo ngare nyi Esowo lꞌkpe ko bo? Bahke jolo elkpin ka akvne. <verse eid="ROM 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16" />Ngbokambang lꞌfere jol ka Esowo, ane ebe bako kpee tob li ka-e fvfo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 17:16,19</char></note> Nlohk eti lꞌjol ka Esowo, abꞌbo tob li ka ye fvfo.<verse eid="ROM 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17" />Esowo ebgbakke abꞌbo oliv nyandiki go oliv ji á bahme go ege etahngga. Owo wahnge á kehm-a koko, wo ji li ana mbꞌbo oliv ji li go ekulugbe, ba lak-a edi ji á gbakke abꞌbo nyako, eji a lꞌtob jo bel alahb ma kpo lohng go alohk, fere bel afang nyao nya oliv jio.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ef 2:11-13,19</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18" />Owo wahnge a lꞌkꞌjo daange abꞌbo nyako nya bo ma gbakke tub go. Á lꞌfere lim ano, jo buumu re, wo mbꞌbo, wo sang kpo ka nlohk elkpin. Nlohk nyi kpo ka-a elkpin.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 4:22</char></note><verse eid="ROM 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19" />A bahke bungu re, “Esowo gbakke abꞌbo nyako, eji á lꞌbel eyake, ko-m ba lake.” <verse eid="ROM 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20" />Jio lohko li go etingitingi. Abꞌbo nyao Esowo gbakke tib go bo ekꞌtaame. Eltaame ena ni wahnge a kpe yim. Ka jo geere! Ga nob re wo jo fahl. <verse eid="ROM 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21" />Esowo tahrem abꞌbo nya tohko jol o bum. Anv, a kpꞌtiri re á bahke wo tahre buma? <verse eid="ROM 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22" />Nyehnen, nnoobo nyi Esowo, a elbibi ene ni á kpo bib. Á kpo bib a ane ba ma gbo, fere jo tib-a nnoobo, a lꞌsoro asi go ege a nnoobo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hib 3:14</char></note> Tohko jol ano á bahk-a tob gbahk tub go fvfo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 15:5-6</char></note><verse eid="ROM 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23" />Abꞌbo nyako tohko sa ano ano go bo ekꞌtaame, Esowo bahke kpe feere a bo, ba lake, tibre á kpi nsahm nyi á bahke ma lim ano.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Kor 3:14-16</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24" />Esowo eblim ejum ji ane lꞌkꞌtiki lim, eji á song kim-a, wo ji li ana mbꞌbo oliv ji li go ekulugbe, fere ko-a ba lake go oliv ji á bahme go ege etahngga. Lꞌlim renan, á lꞌkꞌko abꞌbo nya tohko jol o, feere a nya ba lake go bo etii?<verse eid="ROM 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Esowo bahke fere ko Israel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25" />Abonanee, n kpꞌsebe re wahn kahn ejum jia ji li mbehr mbehr, eji ń lꞌkꞌjo geere kak elnahne. Ejange Israel ajehng ebfere tahne asi. Etahnsi jio bahke jolo tete rehng ngare nyi nfange ane baka baka ma biingi, ba bahke bake goji Esowo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 21:24</char></note><verse eid="ROM 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26" />Owo Israel kpee bahke kehm bele eltahre, ana nwer Esowo bungu no re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:26">“Ntꞌtahre bahke lohngo go Sayon ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:26">ba yehke abꞌbi nya wob go etꞌtohngo ji Jekob.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 23:39; Ell 1:7</char></note><verse eid="ROM 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27" />A wo li egbanngalung ji m bahke limi a bo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:27">Ngare nyio nyi m bahke ruku abiafem ebo.”<verse eid="ROM 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28" />Tib eji bo tene nnoobo etib, owo wahnge bo ma fere jol anebekv ba Esowo tib go egahne esi. Tib eji Esowo ma yehke bo, bo kpeke li akpondahme enye tib go esi ji babnde ebo. <verse eid="ROM 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29" />Tibre Esowo kpehme yaange ntir atahng enye bade ane ba á lꞌyehke bo, a ayare enye. <verse eid="ROM 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30" />Wahn ane baka baka, wuku wuku ń taamem tv Esowo. Anv, Esowo ma-n tib ndon enye tib go bo ekꞌtaame. <verse eid="ROM 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31" />Ano wo fvfo bo ki tob taame tv Esowo, eji Esowo lꞌtob tib bo ndon enye, ana á ma-n tib.<verse eid="ROM 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32" />Tibre Esowo eblim ane kpee ebwoomo go ngbekobo nyi ekꞌtaame ebo, eji á lꞌtib bo ane kpee ndon enye.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gal 3:22</char></note><verse eid="ROM 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33" />Afang nya Esowo, elkahne ene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:33">a elgbere ene ebsehnge eso.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:33">Nne awo bahke ma ko Esowo elfono?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:33">Nne awo bahke ma kahn mbang nyi Esowo kpo lim nsol enye?<verse eid="ROM 11:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34" />Ana nwer Esowo bungu no re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:34">“Nne awo kpꞌkahne ntir nyi Jehova?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:34">Nne awo tub-e elle?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 2:16</char></note><verse eid="ROM 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35" />Nne awo ma kꞌka Esowo ejum ji Esowo bahk-e gale?”<verse eid="ROM 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36" />Nsol kpee lohng go ege.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:36">Ye wo wahnge nsol kpee li no.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:36">Nsol kpee li ka ye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:36">Nong, ellub jol ka-e go njinanjini. Emen.<verse eid="ROM 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12" />
  <para style="s">Eljini ni nne Esowo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1" />Fvfo, abonanee, n kp-n gboongo tib go ndon nyi Esowo re, wahn yake agubjing enyahne ka ana ejum njom ji li go elkpin, ji bahke jolo ka Esowo bi bi, jio ji á bahke koko. Ano wo fuumu re wahn jo kak Esowo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Pit 2:5</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2" />Kana jol jang jang ana njini nyia. Jo belen ntir atahng nyi nfenfe, eji elkpin enahne lꞌjo yaange. Ana wo ḿ bahke jo kahn mbang nyi Esowo, fere kahn ji kpꞌnobo, ji kpo kor Esowo, ji li go nseenga nseenge.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ef 4:23; 5:10,17</char></note><verse eid="ROM 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3" />Tib go nnoobo nyi Esowo ma-m ka, nyi nyi wahnge n kpꞌgboongo nne awohng awohng ewahne re, á kꞌjo geere kak ejum ji á ki kpi. Jo tiren nob nob, wahn kahn ji ḿ bahke jo lim go ayare nya Esowo ma-n ka, ana nya nne awohng awohng ewahne ma bel.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 12:11; Ef 4:7</char></note><verse eid="ROM 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4" />E li ana ngubjing anyehng nyi kpi ajoobo gbalee. Wo, eltum anehng sang bo kpi no. <verse eid="ROM 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5" />Ano wo fvfo wahr tob li ngubjing anyehng a Kraist, jol eji e li li egom. Ejum ngubjing ajehng ajehng bobjabbe kono edi ajehng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 12:4-31</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6" />Nong, wahr ko ajoobo ayare nya Esowo ma-r ka, jo lim eltum, ana á ma-r ka nnoobo. Afi jolo ayare nya amahr anyehne, nong, wahr lim jang jang ana e ma bel. <verse eid="ROM 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7" />Lꞌfere jol elloko, nong, wahr jo loko. Nne no kpo tib, nong, á jo tib. <verse eid="ROM 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8" />Nne no kpo kak erehke, nong, á jo rehke. Nne no kpo yare ane ka nsol, nong, á jo ka go eltim anehng. Nne no li ntubesi, nong, á jo kak ekpuku go ejum ajehng ajehng. Nne no kpo lim nnoobo, nong, á jo lim go eyebatahng.<verse eid="ROM 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9" />Nong, elkoro enahne jol elkohn ni li go etingitingi, abꞌbi jo sab-n, wahn fere tahm tonngo go nsol nyi kpꞌnobo. <verse eid="ROM 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10" />Belen elkoro atemtem nio ni abonanyehn nne. Nong, nne awohng awohng jo bum ntem ana njꞌjoka nne.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fil 2:3</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11" />Jo kaken ekpuku go eltum alimi. Kana jo gbo ewon! Jo kaken esi go nsol nyi etohko, wahn jo loko Esowo.<verse eid="ROM 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12" />Jo belen eyebatahng go nsol nyi ń kpꞌkunu ekpu. Jo kpuumen erem, wahn fere jo kak ero ngare anyehng anyehng. <verse eid="ROM 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13" />Jo kaken aneb Esowo ebo, ba li go elehng nsol, wahn fere jo vvrv ajenne.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hib 13:2</char></note><verse eid="ROM 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14" />Jo biren nnoobo tv ane ba kp-n nohko. Jo biren na nnoobo tv ane, kana jo su bo! <verse eid="ROM 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15" />Jo tob belen eyebatahng a ane ba kpi eyebatahng, wahn tob jo ling a ane ba kpꞌlingi. <verse eid="ROM 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16" />Jolen go ntir na anyehng! Kana jo nok re wahn lim nsol elgahm! Jo jenen a ane ba li rede rede. Kana jo geere kak elkahne enahne!<verse eid="ROM 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17" />Nne awohng awohng no lꞌlim-n ebi, kana jo ko ebi, feer-e. Jo garen ana ḿ bahke jo lim nsol nyi ane kpee kpꞌkahne re kpꞌnobo. <verse eid="ROM 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18" />Jo noken go mbang anyehng anyehng, eji limi limi kan, ń lꞌjol go elkoono a ane kpee.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hib 12:14</char></note><verse eid="ROM 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19" />Akpondahme enyame, kana jo bongo afem enyahne antahng. Yaken ka erakatahng ji Esowo. Tibre nwer Esowo bungu re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:19">“Me wo li mbꞌbongo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:19">Me wo bahke bongo afem.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:19">Ana wo Jehova bungu no.”<verse eid="ROM 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20" />Ga nob re wahn lim ji nwer Esowo bungu no re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:20">“Nnekv ewa, njal lꞌyam-e,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:20">ka-e, á li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:20">Alahb lꞌkor-e, ka-e, á wo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:20">A lꞌlim ano,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:20">li ana a ma kpar akal ngun kun-e go esi.”<verse eid="ROM 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21" />Ka taame, abꞌbi ga-a. Ko nnoobo, wo ga abꞌbi.<verse eid="ROM 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13" />
  <para style="s">Jo wuken atubesi ejahbe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1" />Nong, nne awohng awohng jo woomo go elwo ni atubesi ejahbe. Tibre ntubesi awohng awohng limm, no Esowo ki-e ka nsahm. Ye wo yehke atubesi kpee bum.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tait 3:1</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2" />Fvfo, nne no lꞌten atahm nya atubesi jehke no, yebtob ten Esowo bi ma yehke atubesi bao bum. Ane ba lꞌten bo, bo bahke nyehne erem.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Pit 4:15-16</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3" />Tibre ane ba kpo lim nob nob, limm re bo kpe fahl atubesi. Ane ba kpo lim abꞌbi, bo ba bahke jo fahl atubesi. Anv, a kpꞌsebe re wo kꞌjo fahl atubesia? Lꞌlun, lim ji kpꞌnobo, bo bahk-a tehke.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Pit 2:13-14</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4" />Tibre bo alokeltum Esowo ba, tib eji lꞌnob a na. A lꞌlim ebi, nꞌnob re wo jo fahl. Tibre Esowo kaam bo nsahm nyi erem akake mbol mbol. Bo ba li alokeltum ba Esowo yehke no bum re bo jo kak nne no kpꞌlimi ebi erem. <verse eid="ROM 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5" />Owo wahnge nobo re wo woomo bo go elwo. Ka woomo go bo elwo, tib eji a kpꞌsebe re wo for go erem. Jo woomo bo go elwo, eji a lꞌbel eltim ni nno go esamahr bi Esowo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ef 6:7</char></note><verse eid="ROM 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6" />Esi jꞌnehm ji wahnge ḿ bahke jo tahb etak. Tibre atubesi, alokeltum Esowo ba kpi nlimi nlimi eltum nio asongo. <verse eid="ROM 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7" />Jo kaan bo ane kpee ji fuumu re wahn ka bo. Jo tahben etak ka ane ba fuumu a bo, wahn jo tob kpi akpohko go nsol nyindiki nyi atubesi lꞌtong-n re wahn kpi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 22:21</char></note> Jo fahlen nne no fuumu re wahn fahl-e, wahn jo kak nne no fuumu re wahn kak-e.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 5:29</char></note><verse eid="ROM 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nne no kpi elkoro, ye wo ma bum atahm Esowo kpee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8" />Kana bel nne awohng awohng mbong, sehngem elkoro ni ḿ bahke bele atemtem. Tibre nne no, nne noko lꞌjo kor-e, yebbum atahm nya Esowo kpee.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 22:37-40</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9" />Atahm nya li re, “Ka lim erehbe, ka wul nne, ka v ejv, ka jo baare amahr go nsol ane”, a ntahm anyehng anyehng nyehko gona, nne li ma fadde, fere bung ellumlum anehng re, “Nne ebjing ewa jo kor-a ana ebjing eba.” <verse eid="ROM 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10" />Nne awohng awohng no nne noko lꞌkor-e, we á nehm soodo. Fvfo, elkoro ni li atahm Esowo abumu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gal 5:14; 1 Tim 1:5</char></note><verse eid="ROM 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11" />Jo limen jia, tibre ń kpꞌkahne ana ngare nyia li no.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 16:3</char></note> Ngare ebbiingi nyi ḿ bahke nyahme go ellu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 12:37</char></note> Tibre anv wo, eltahre ma-r ga kabbe, sehnge ngare nyi e gbo mbang taame tv Esowo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fil 3:20-21</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12" />Ejannge kpeem ga li. Efungfu yahke se. Owo wahnge nobo re wahr yaken nsol nyi li ka ejannge, fere kak nsol ebta nyio nyi ellennge.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ef 6:11-17</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13" />Nong, wahr jo jen nob nob ana ane ba kpꞌjene ngara njul, ba ane kpi bo kpur. Kana jo jen, jo bahn ase yannge, fere jo wo amahm, jo lim ana kor-n no, fere jo kon anebkal, jo nok abohng, fere bel eteelala.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 12:45</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14" />Kaken Ntul a Jisos Kraist ana ewobo, wahn kꞌjo yehke ekpu kunu go ngubjing, eji ngubjing lꞌkꞌjo lim ji kp-e koro.<verse eid="ROM 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14" />
  <para style="s">Kana jo lam abonane ebahne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1" />Jo koon nne no kil tahne go mbang nyi Esowo. Kana jo lim nfaabe a ne bada nsol nyi á kpꞌtaame tv.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 15:1</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2" />Nne nondiki kpo taame re, nne li ma li nsol alehke anyehng anyehng. Nne no kil tahne go mbang nyi Esowo, á kpo li anyane anyane.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kol 2:16-17; 1 Kor 8:8; Mat 15:11</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3" />Nong, nne no kpo li ejum ajehng ajehng kꞌjo daange nne no kil jo li. Nne no kil jo li, á kꞌjo lam nne no kpo li ejum ajehng ajehng. Tibre Esowo m-e ko. <verse eid="ROM 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4" />Wo elkohn nne awo, no bahke lame nlokeltum no nne noko? Yefono nde wo bahke kahne antahng, joare nlokeltum noo bahke yiimi, afi á bahke gboko. Á bahke yiimi. Tibre Esowo bi li nde no we bahk-e ma lim, á yiimi.<verse eid="ROM 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5" />Nne nondiki kpo tir re, efung bindiki bi ga li egburu efung sehnge afung nyako. Nne noko tir re, afung kpee li jang jang.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gal 4:10-11</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6" />Nne no kpo bum ekahmekahme efung, á kpo lim tib esi ji Jehova. Nne no kpo li ejum ajehng ajehng, á kpo lim ano tib esi ji Esowo, tib eji á kpo kak Esowo saam go nsol alehke nyio. Nne no kil jo li nsol nyindiki, á kpo tob lim ano tib esi ji Esowo, fere jo kak-e saam.<verse eid="ROM 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7" />Tibre nne ewahre awohng awohng limm, no kpi elne antahng, jol afi á li go elkpin, afi á kpo na. <verse eid="ROM 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8" />Afi e li go elkpin, e li ka Jehova. Afi e kpo na, e kpo, ka ye. Afi e li go elkpin, afi e fere kpo na, e li ka Jehova.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Tes 5:10</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9" />Ji wahnge Kraist kpo no, á kpo, fere nyahme, jol go elkpin, eji á lꞌjol ntul no akvne, a aneb mbir mbir. <verse eid="ROM 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10" />Jen ji wahnge a kpo lam mmonanne? Wo jia, jen ji wahnge a kpo daange mmonanne? Tibre wahr ane kpee bahke yiimi go eti elam ji Esowo.<verse eid="ROM 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11" />Tibre nwer Esowo bungu re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">“Jehova ebtir elne re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">Ana n li go elkpin,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">nne awohng awohng bahk-m jamme alahng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">fere taame re, me Esowo bi.”<verse eid="ROM 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12" />Fvfo, Esowo bahke bahbe nne ewahre awohng awohng antahng bade ana á limi no.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gal 6:5</char></note><verse eid="ROM 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kana jo lim re abonane ebahne jo gbo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13" />Fvfo, nong, wahr kiin kpe lam atemtem. Ga nob re wahr jo kunu ekpu, eji e lꞌkꞌwahng mmonanne ewahne sel, tohko jol ano á gbo yel abiafem. <verse eid="ROM 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14" />Eji n li ka Ntul a Jisos, n kpꞌsahb kꞌkahn re, ejumjum limm, ji ki li saang.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 10:10-15</char></note> Nne lꞌfere bum re, ejum jia limm saang, ejum jio ebfere jol ejum ji ki li saang ka-e.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 14:2; 1 Kor 8:7</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15" />Ejum ji a kpꞌlehke lꞌsab mmonanne, lohngo re, a nehme kpe jen go mbang nyi elkoro. Nong, ejum ji a kpꞌlehke kꞌwahng nne no Kraist kpo ka-e, rannge.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 8:9</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16" />Ka taame, ejum ji a kpꞌkahne re kpꞌnobo bel ebi mbing. <verse eid="ROM 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17" />Tibre etul bi Esowo wobem go nsol alehke, wobem go elwoko.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 17:20</char></note> Li go mbang nyi nne kpꞌlimi nsol nyi li go etingitingi, fere bel elkoono, a eyebatahng ji Etingi Etohko kpo ka. <verse eid="ROM 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18" />Nne lꞌloko Kraist go mbang nyia, Esowo bahk-e koko, ane bahke jo tehk-e tehk.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 4:24</char></note><verse eid="ROM 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19" />Nong, wahr jo noken, jo lim nsol nyi bahke koko elkoono ba a ni, fere jo kak atemtem ebo, eji e lꞌgbal. <verse eid="ROM 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20" />Ka jo rannge eltum ni Esowo kpꞌlimi tib nsol alehke. Ejum ajehng ajehng li saang. Nobem re nne li ejum ajehng ajehng ji bahke limi nne noko á gbo yel go abiafem. <verse eid="ROM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21" />Nobo re á kꞌjo li nnyam, fere jo wo amahm, fere jo lim ejum ajehng ajehng ji bahke wahnge mmonannyehn gbo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 8:13</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22" />Lꞌjol re a kpꞌsahb kꞌkahn re, nsol nyimongo nyi a kpꞌlimi li nob nob go esamahr Esowo, nong, jol-a go ega atahng, wo a Esowo. Eyebatahng li a nne no kil lame elne, eji á kpꞌlimi ji á kpꞌkahne re kpꞌnobo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 10:25</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23" />Nne no lꞌjo faabe, á lꞌfere li nsol nyio, yebli ebi. Tibre ji á limi no lohngem go elkahne ni á ma kahn mbang nyi Esowo. Wo, ejum ajehng ajehng ji tohko lohng go elkahne nio, abiafem nya.<verse eid="ROM 14:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15" />
  <para style="s">Jo koon atemtem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1" />Wahr ji ma tahne go mbang nyi Esowo, nobo re wahr jo kaken ane ba kil tahne ebo. Nong, wahr kꞌjo lim ji bahke jo kor wahrfono antahng. <verse eid="ROM 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2" />Ga nob re wahr jo lim ji bahke jo kor mmonanne ewahre, eji lꞌjo nob a ne, á fere gbal go mbang nyi Esowo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 9:19; 10:24-33</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3" />Tibre Kraist joom lim ji jo kor yefono antahng. Ana nwer Esowo bungu no, “Akuk nya bo jo su Esowo, nya nya ma fere gbo kuum-m.” <verse eid="ROM 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4" />Tibre ejum ajehng ajehng ji bo nyono go nwer Esowo wuku wuku, bo nyono re, jo ka-r elle,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 10:11</char></note> eji e lꞌbel ekunukpu tib go elkpuumu ni nwer Esowo kp-r tibi, a ekakeltim eje. <verse eid="ROM 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5" />Nong, Esowo bi elkpuumu, bi kpo kak ane eltim, lim-n, wahn jol go elkoono atemtem, ana Kraist tibi no, <verse eid="ROM 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6" />eji ń lꞌjo tehk Esowo wahn ane kpee nnyo nnyo amehng, ye ji li nde no Jisos Kraist ntul ewahre.<verse eid="ROM 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7" />Fvfo, nobo re wahn jo ko atemtem, jang jang ana Kraist ko-n no, eji Esowo lꞌbel ellub. <verse eid="ROM 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8" />Tibre n kp-n tongo re, Kraist bꞌba, ba jol nlokeltum no Jus,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 15:24; 20:28</char></note> eji lꞌtib re, Esowo li nkakesehk a nne, fere lim enyam bi á nyame tong babnso ejahre, <verse eid="ROM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9" />eji ane baka baka lꞌka Esowo ellub tib go ege a ndon. Ana nwer Esowo bungu no re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:9">“M bahk-a tehke go ellong ane baka baka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:9">fere yim ase,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:9">jo tehk mbing enya.”<verse eid="ROM 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10" />Nwer Esowo kpe bung re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:10">“Ane baka baka, belen eyebatahng a aneb Esowo!”<verse eid="ROM 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11" />Nwer Esowo kpe bung re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:11">“Tehken Jehova, wahn ane baka baka kpee.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:11">Nong, ane kpee tehk-e.”<verse eid="ROM 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12" />Aisaya kpe bung re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">“Nlohk nyi Jesi bahke bake,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">ye ji bo bahk-e mehle wahre re</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">á fili ane baka baka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">Ye wo, ane baka baka bahke jo kun-e ekpu.”<verse eid="ROM 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13" />Nong, Esowo bi li nfono ekunukpu gohr-n ruru eyebatahng, a elkoono tib eji ḿ ma taame tv-e, eji ekunukpu ejahne lꞌjo gbal asongo tib go nsahm Etingi Etohko.<verse eid="ROM 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ji wahnge wahng Pol nyono nwer nyia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14" />Abonanee, mefono antahng kpꞌsahb kꞌkahn re, nnoobo ebrur go egahna ntim, a elkahne kpee, fvfo, ḿ bahke ma tob jo rehke atemtem. <verse eid="ROM 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15" />Nwer nyia, n nyono esahb esahb, eji n lꞌbuum-n nsol nyimongo tib go nnoobo nyi Esowo ma-m ka re,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 1:5</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16" />me n jol nlokeltum no Kraist Jisos ka ane baka baka. N kpꞌlimi eltum ana nlimajom, eji n kpꞌtiingi nnoobo etib bi Esowo re me n ko ane baka baka ba ka Esowo ana ayare nya Esowo bahke koko, nya Etingi Etohko ma lim re, jol eje eje ka Esowo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 11:13</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17" />Eji n li ajehng a Kraist, n li ma geere kak eltum ni n kpꞌlimi ka Esowo. <verse eid="ROM 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18" />Tibre n nehme sahb bung ejumjum, sehngem ji Kraist ma-m ko lim, ji ji m bahke jo bung,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Kor 3:5</char></note> eji ane baka baka lꞌtaame tv Esowo, fere jo wuk-e, tib go nsol nyi n kpꞌbungu, fere jo lim. <verse eid="ROM 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19" />Tibre Esowo ka-m nsahm re me n tib nliingi, fere lim akpokosi go nsahm nyio nyi Etingi Etohko.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 19:12-13</char></note> Owo n kehm tahme song tiingi nnoobo etib bi Kraist, tong nne awohng awohng, bomo go Jeusalem, woor song rehng Illirikum. <verse eid="ROM 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20" />Ntir enyame ga li re, me n song tiingi nnoobo etib go adi nya bo kala kahn mbing nyi Kraist, eji n lꞌkꞌjol ana nne no kpo si kunu go nnahb ekahme nyi nne nondiki ma bum.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Kor 10:15-16</char></note><verse eid="ROM 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21" />Ana nwer Esowo bungu no re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:21">“Ane ba, bo kala tꞌtong bo bada ne, bahke nyehne.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:21">Ane ba kala wꞌwuk, bahke kahne.”<verse eid="ROM 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Pol jo seb re á nyehn aneb ero ba jolo go Rom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22" />Ejum ji ana, ji kpo kon-m elkpane re me n kꞌba go egahne. <verse eid="ROM 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23" />Ebkang nnya tvv nyi m bomo elsebe re me m ba go egahne, ba nyehn-n, wo anv, eji eltum ename ma mal go ajang ajahbe nyaa, <verse eid="ROM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24" />me m bum re, m bahk-n nyehne, eji n kpꞌsehnge tahm go Spein.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 1:10-13</char></note> N kpꞌbumu re, ḿ bahk-m song tv, ngare nyi m ma ba kang a nahne abon afung ntiil, fere bel eyebatahng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 16:6</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25" />Anv, n yahke ba eltahme go Jeusalem re me n song kak aneb Esowo ebo. <verse eid="ROM 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26" />Tibre aneb ero ba li go Masedonia, a Akaya ebkor bo re bo tahb akpohko nya bo bahke kake aneb Esowo ba li go Jeusalem, ba li akpak.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 16:1-4; 2 Kor 8:1-4</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27" />Jo koro bo re bo lim ano. Etingitingi, bo kpi bo mbong. Eji ane baka baka ma tob bel elfuulu ebo ni etohko, li ka bo re bo tob kak Jus ebo go nsol nyehka nyehka. <verse eid="ROM 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28" />Ngare nyi m ma lim ajehng ajehng mal, fere ka bo akpohko nyao, m bahke ba sehng go egahne, tahm go Spein.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 19:21</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29" />N kpꞌkahne re, n lꞌba go egahne, m bahke bake a elfuulu ni Kraist kpee.<verse eid="ROM 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30" />Abonanee, n kp-n gboongo, tib eji ń kpꞌkahne Jisos Kraist, Ntul ewahre, fere kahn elkoro ni Etingi Etohko kpo ka, re wahn jo nok, jo tob-m go ero akake ka Esowo, <verse eid="ROM 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31" />eji Esowo lꞌtahr-m yehke go abo nya ane ba kala taame tv-e ba li go Judea, eji aneb Esowo ba li go Jeusalem lꞌko ekakebo ji m bahke bo ka go eyebatahng. <verse eid="ROM 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32" />Owo m bahke kehm bake go egahne a eyebatahng, Esowo lꞌtaame, fere ba bel ekakeltim a nahne a nahne. <verse eid="ROM 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33" />Nong, Esowo bi elkoono jol a nahne, wahn ane kpee. Emen.<verse eid="ROM 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16" />
  <para style="s">Nnyo akake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1" />N kpꞌlennge mmonanne ewahne no nkal ka-n, no bo kpo lung-e re Fibi. Á li nlokeltum ero go ero bi li go Kenkrea. <verse eid="ROM 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2" />Á lꞌba, koon ye go mbing nyi Ntul a Jisos, ana fuumu re aneb Esowo jo lim, wahn jo kak-e ebo go ejum ajehng ajehng ji á lꞌseb. Tibre yebkak ane gbalee ebo, a mefono fvfo.<verse eid="ROM 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3" />Kaken Priska, a Akwila nnyo, ba e kpo lim eltum anehng a bo, ni Kraist Jisos.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 18:2-3</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4" />Bobtaame elkv tib go egame esi. N kpꞌkake bo saam, jol me ntahngtahng sang na, aneb ero baka kpee ba ki li Jus fvfo kpꞌtob kak bo saam. <verse eid="ROM 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5" />Kaken aneb ero ba kpo kono nkon go bo etahk nnyo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:5">Kaken Epanetus ekpondahme ejame nnyo, ye ji gbo mbang taame tv Kraist go Esia. <verse eid="ROM 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6" />Kaken Meri nnyo, ye ji jo kak eko, jo lim eltum ka-n. <verse eid="ROM 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7" />Kaken Andronikus nnyo, a Junias, bo ji e wob ngbekobo ano, ba tob li Jus ana me, bo ji abatiingetib kpo kak bo. Bo ba gbo mbang taame tv Kraist ka me. <verse eid="ROM 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8" />Kaken Ampliatur nnyo, ji li ekpondahme ejame go ejang bi Ntul a Jisos. <verse eid="ROM 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9" />Kaken Uranus nnyo, ji kpo tob lim eltum ni Kraist ana wahr. Kaken Stakis, ekpondahme ejame nnyo. <verse eid="ROM 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10" />Kaken Apelles nnyo, ye ji ma lohko tib re, ye li ka Kraist. Kaken ane ba lene etahk Aristobolus nnyo. <verse eid="ROM 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11" />Kaken Herodion nnyo, ye ji tob li nne a Jus ana me. Kaken aneb Esowo nnyo, ba li etahk Narsisus.<verse eid="ROM 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12" />Kaken Trifena, a Trifosa nnyo, bo ji kpꞌlimi eltum ni Jehova. Kaken Persis ekpondahme ejame nnyo, ye ji ma sahb kꞌkak eko go eltum Esowo alimi. <verse eid="ROM 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13" />Kaken Rufus nnyo, ye ji kpꞌgaka lim eltum Esowo, a nnyehn no tob li nnee.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mak 15:21</char></note><verse eid="ROM 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14" />Kaken Asinkritus nnyo, a Flegon, Hermes, Patrobas, Hermas, a abonanee ba li a bo. <verse eid="ROM 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15" />Kaken Filologus nnyo, a Julia, Nereus, a mmonannyehn no nkal, go Olimpas, a aneb Esowo bako kpee ba tob li a bo o. <verse eid="ROM 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16" />Kaken atemtem nnyo go nnyo asodo ana abonanyehn nne. Aneb ero ba Kraist kpee kp-n kake nnyo.<verse eid="ROM 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Esꞌkohro erehke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17" />Abonanee, n kp-n gboongo re, wahn jo gbere ane ba kpo ko nyꞌyabe ba a nyi, fere jo kpan eltum ni Esowo, eji bo kpꞌtibi eltibi nindikandiki, ni bo kal-n tꞌtib. Yaamen a bo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tait 3:10</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18" />Tibre elkohn ane bao kpehme loko Ntul a Jisos Kraist. Bo kpo loko bofono antahng. Bo li ayebe anyo ane ba kpo foolo anyo, jo nehm ane ba kil jo tir re, ane bako kpi ebi eltim. <verse eid="ROM 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19" />Nne awohng awohng ebwuk bade ana n kpo lim jang jang ana nwer Esowo bungu no. Ji ji wahnge n kpꞌgeere kak-n. N kpꞌsebe re wahn jol akahnkahn ane ba kpꞌkahne ana bo bahke jo lim nnoobo, fere jol ana abonbili ba kil kahne abꞌbi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 14:20</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20" />Owo Esowo bi elkoono bahke kehm wade nnehm elwaare, wahn kun-e akpade. Nong, nnoobo nyi Ntul a Jisos Kraist jol a nahne.<verse eid="ROM 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21" />Timoti ji e kpo lim eltum ano, kp-n tob kak nnyo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 16:1-3</char></note> Lusius kp-n kake nnyo, a Jeson, a Sosipater, bo ji tob li Jus ana me. <verse eid="ROM 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22" />Me Tersus ji kpꞌnyono nwer nyia, n kp-n kake nnyo go mbing nyi Jehova.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Tes 3:17-18</char></note><verse eid="ROM 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23" />Gayus kp-n tob kak nnyo, ye ji n li go ege etahk, ye jio ji aneb ero kpo ba kono nkon go ege etahk. Erastus kp-n kake nnyo, ye ji kpo kuuru akpohko nfam. Mmonanne ejahre Kwartus kp-n tob kak nnyo. <verse eid="ROM 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24" />Nong, nnoobo nyi Ntul a Jisos Kraist jol a nahne. Emen. <verse eid="ROM 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25" />Nong, wahr kaan Esowo ellub, ye ji bahk-n ma lim ń yiimi tꞌtahne, ń lꞌtoono nnoobo etib bi n kpꞌtiingi, bi li alum Esowo bada Jisos Kraist, ana Esowo ma lennge nsol nyia nyi á behre no mahne mahne.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kol 1:26</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26" />Anv, nsol nyia eblennge gbuul sehng go alum nya abanyehnamahr Esowo nyono no, ane kpee ebkahn ana Esowo bi li go njinanjini tongo no re bo taame tv-e, fere jo wuk-e. <verse eid="ROM 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27" />Nong, Esowo bi kpi elkahne ntahngtahng bel ellub go njinanjini, ni kpo sehng go abo nya Jisos Kraist. Emen.<verse eid="ROM 16:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16" />
</usx>